<http://localhost:5002/fb5c8064-287d-42b3-9f00-d2f1b0ec23f4> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Monitoring of hybrid workpiece deviations by process signals".
<http://localhost:5002/fb5c8064-287d-42b3-9f00-d2f1b0ec23f4> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Dataset includes data resources of subprojects A04, B01 and B05. Investigations of process signals using different process parameters are conducted.".
