<http://localhost:5002/9b7b6b77-0d8a-475b-a421-ef828de40d68> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset contains the simulation code of the numerical example in the paper _Nonlinear moving horizon estimation for robust state and parameter estimation_.  The provided MATLAB code runs a moving horizon estimation algorithm for joint state and parameter estimation of a modified Chua\\'s Circuit system. Please refer to the README for instructions on how to execute the code and the requirements.".
