<http://localhost:5002/79549057-5f9b-4037-9e65-9e98219db39c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>.
<http://localhost:5002/79549057-5f9b-4037-9e65-9e98219db39c> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2Fhl5nqg81>.
<http://localhost:5002/79549057-5f9b-4037-9e65-9e98219db39c> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Bethe ansatz data for the staggered six-vertex model with antidiagonal boundary conditions".
<http://localhost:5002/79549057-5f9b-4037-9e65-9e98219db39c> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe ansatz data for the dual and non-dual configurations of an excited state. Further, Bethe roots data for the ground state and first excited state of the staggered six-vertex model with antidiagonal boundary conditions in phase III.  For details see Holger Frahm and Sascha Gehrmann: \\'Finite-size spectrum of the staggered six-vertex model with antidiagonal boundary conditions\\', Nucl. Phys. B __1006__ (2024) 116655 [arXiv:2405.20919].".
<http://localhost:5002/79549057-5f9b-4037-9e65-9e98219db39c> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "79549057-5f9b-4037-9e65-9e98219db39c".
<http://localhost:5002/79549057-5f9b-4037-9e65-9e98219db39c> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-08-12T09:49:46.262107"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/79549057-5f9b-4037-9e65-9e98219db39c> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T09:49:46.262115"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/79549057-5f9b-4037-9e65-9e98219db39c> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> <http://localhost:5002/organization/ag-frahm>.
