<http://localhost:5002/d3855a3c-3aa8-474b-a0b0-e64be16a5968> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>.
<http://localhost:5002/d3855a3c-3aa8-474b-a0b0-e64be16a5968> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2F0028359>.
<http://localhost:5002/d3855a3c-3aa8-474b-a0b0-e64be16a5968> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Importance of Antixenosis and Antibiosis Resistance to the Cabbage Whitefly (Aleyrodes proletella) in Brussels Sprout Cultivars".
<http://localhost:5002/d3855a3c-3aa8-474b-a0b0-e64be16a5968> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The data are parts of the BSc-Thesis of Christina Paul Gartenbauwissenschaften) with the title:  \\'Resistenzpotential verschiedener Rosenkohlsorten (Brassica oleracea L. var. gemmifera DC.) gegenüber der Kohlmottenschildlaus Aleyrodes proletella (L.) (Hemiptera: Aleyrodidae)\\' from 2014 and her MSc-Thesis \\'Untersuchungen zu Resistenzmechanismen von Rosenkohl (Brassica oleracea L. var. gemmifera DC.) gegenüber der Kohlmottenschildlaus Aleyrodes proletella (L.) (Hemiptera: Aleyrodidae)\\'  from 2017 at Institute of Horticultural production Systems, Sec. Phytomedicine.   The data were also collected for the project \\'Neue Ansätze zur Bekämpfung der Kohlmottenschildlaus (Aleyrodes proletella) einem Problemschädling im Kohlanbau\\' and are partly published in the final report of the project (https://orgprints.org/32012/1/32012-12NA022-luh-meyhoefer-2016-bekaempfung-kohlmottenschildlaus.pdf). The project was funded by BLE in context of \\'Bundesprogramm Ökologischer Landbau und andere Formen nachhaltiger Landwirtschaft\\', grant number: 2812NA022.  All data are published 2019/2020 in the journal Insects 2020, 11, 56; https://doi.org/10.3390/insects11010056  Detailed methods of data collection and analyses are desribed in the paper and final report as mentioned above.  The files were created by MS Excel 2016.".
