<http://localhost:5002/8ab65480-7da1-41f2-8236-f6bdf32b2498> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-08-12T09:48:38.871620"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/8ab65480-7da1-41f2-8236-f6bdf32b2498> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T09:48:38.871629"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/8ab65480-7da1-41f2-8236-f6bdf32b2498> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> <http://localhost:5002/organization/abteilung-mineralogie>.
