<http://localhost:5002/04d36e33-d844-4cf4-9e38-210959473ff4> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "All data are analysed and published 2023 under the title \\' \\'Keep an eye on natural enemies: What Aphidius on sticky traps tells us about aphid pest population dynamics\\' in the Journal Entomologia Experimentalis et Applicata; https://doi.org/10.1111/eea.13360  Detailed methods of data collection and analyses are desribed in the paper. The files were created by MS Excel 2016.".
