<http://localhost:5002/f707bb9b-9e28-451b-a08e-d04be6a1905c> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Highlights - Novel multiphysics modeling of Nafion membranes for water electrolysis in green hydrogen production. - Electro-chemo-hydro-mechanical model based on the Theory of Porous Media, solved monolithically via finite elements. - Numerical results replicate membrane behavior under operational conditions, capturing its complex interactions. - Open-source codes and data ensure reproducibility and transparency.".
