<http://localhost:5002/b39cfbd2-2cfc-42eb-8b13-26a4d771cde4> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2F0056607>.
<http://localhost:5002/b39cfbd2-2cfc-42eb-8b13-26a4d771cde4> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Reflectance and EQE measurements of CoTex (colored textiles) photovoltaic modules".
<http://localhost:5002/b39cfbd2-2cfc-42eb-8b13-26a4d771cde4> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Reflectance and EQE measurements of 37 CoTex (colored textiles) BIPV modules. These measurements are used as a basis and validation for simulations of a digital prototype of any colored CoTex modules.".
<http://localhost:5002/b39cfbd2-2cfc-42eb-8b13-26a4d771cde4> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "b39cfbd2-2cfc-42eb-8b13-26a4d771cde4".
