<http://localhost:5002/9bec0195-5890-4a20-a94c-f7c6176f82b0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Sticky trap monitoring of a pest–predator system in glasshouse tomato crops".
<http://localhost:5002/9bec0195-5890-4a20-a94c-f7c6176f82b0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "All data are analysed and published 2017 under the title \\'Sticky trap monitoring of a pest–predator system in glasshouse tomato crops: are available trap colours sufficient?\\' in the Journal of Applied Entomology, 141(5), 339-351. https://doi.org/10.1111/jen.12338   Detailed methods of data collection and analyses are desribed in the paper. The files were created by MS Excel 2016.".
