<http://localhost:5002/a8fb9728-65a0-4751-a976-05fd21793842> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Data from: Impact of restricted phosphorus, calcium-adjusted diet on musculoskeletal and mental health in Hypophosphatasia".
<http://localhost:5002/a8fb9728-65a0-4751-a976-05fd21793842> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset includes the supplementary materials of the publication: Kuehn, K., Hahn, A., Seefried, L. (2023). Impact of restricted phosphorus, calcium-adjusted diet on musculoskeletal and mental health in Hypophosphatasia. It shows the detailed results of the subgroup analyses addressed in the publication. The data presented in the publication/supplementary materials were collected as part of the second stage of the study \\'Nutritional Status and dietary Effects on Phosphorus metabolism and clinical Symptoms in Hypophosphatasia\\' (NuSTEPS).".
