<http://localhost:5002/5b382794-43e1-49ef-8f20-3efab1abdcd9> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2F8g21jk73>.
<http://localhost:5002/5b382794-43e1-49ef-8f20-3efab1abdcd9> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Computer-Aided Engineering Environment (CAEE) for the design generation of individualized shinguards".
<http://localhost:5002/5b382794-43e1-49ef-8f20-3efab1abdcd9> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset contains a script or a Computer-Aided Engineering Environment (CAEE) for Grasshopper (plugin for Rhino), which allows the design of individualized shin guards based on a 3D scan of the leg.   This dataset contains the script of the CAEE and an example scan of a leg in .stl and .3dm.   ![Alt text](https://i.ibb.co/myd6bsH/GH-Skript.png)".
<http://localhost:5002/5b382794-43e1-49ef-8f20-3efab1abdcd9> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "5b382794-43e1-49ef-8f20-3efab1abdcd9".
<http://localhost:5002/5b382794-43e1-49ef-8f20-3efab1abdcd9> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-08-12T09:53:17.657947"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/5b382794-43e1-49ef-8f20-3efab1abdcd9> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T09:53:17.657954"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/5b382794-43e1-49ef-8f20-3efab1abdcd9> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> <http://localhost:5002/organization/institut-fur-produktentwicklung-und-geratebau>.
