<http://localhost:5002/7ece934c-47a1-4582-808e-a87bfc360bea> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Low-cycle fatigue behavior and local deformation of friction welded and heat-treated steel-aluminum hybrid components".
<http://localhost:5002/7ece934c-47a1-4582-808e-a87bfc360bea> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This set provides supplementary data for the following paper: Kahra, C.; Wackenrohr, S.; Nürnberger, F.; Maier, H. J.; Herbst, S.: Low-cycle fatigue behavior and local deformation of friction welded and heat-treated steel-aluminum hybrid components, for the International Journal of Fatigue.  The dataset includes: - the raw data for the tensile tests, fatigue tests and in-situ modul XRM tests.  Acknowledgements: This research was funded by the Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft (DFG, German Research Foundation)—Project-ID 252662854 – SFB 1153.".
