<http://localhost:5002/f109dedb-e1ac-44ac-a88f-e449ea17849f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>.
<http://localhost:5002/f109dedb-e1ac-44ac-a88f-e449ea17849f> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2Fhbxp5xp0>.
<http://localhost:5002/f109dedb-e1ac-44ac-a88f-e449ea17849f> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Topography_CFS".
<http://localhost:5002/f109dedb-e1ac-44ac-a88f-e449ea17849f> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This data repository contains the Abaqus model results presented in the manuscript \\'Importance of forearc topography for the triggering of aftershocks of megathrust earthquakes: Insights from mechanical models and the Tohoku-Oki and Maule earthquakes\\' by A. Dielforder, G. M. Bocchini, and A. Hampel. The manuscript has been submitted to Solid Earth.".
<http://localhost:5002/f109dedb-e1ac-44ac-a88f-e449ea17849f> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "f109dedb-e1ac-44ac-a88f-e449ea17849f".
<http://localhost:5002/f109dedb-e1ac-44ac-a88f-e449ea17849f> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-08-12T10:25:25.978965"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
