<http://localhost:5002/874c884e-386e-4768-9b71-8c00422cd119> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> <http://localhost:5002/organization/institut-fur-fertigungstechnik-und-werkzeugmaschinen>.
<http://localhost:5002/874c884e-386e-4768-9b71-8c00422cd119> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://data.uni-hannover.de/dataset/surface-roughness-dataset-for-high-gloss-milling-of-en-aw-7075-using-mcd-tool-on-kern-micro-hd>.
<http://localhost:5002/874c884e-386e-4768-9b71-8c00422cd119> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/temporal> _:874c884e-386e-4768-9b71-8c00422cd119.
