<http://localhost:5002/26ce6f91-666a-4ab4-b04a-762a678e034e> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "All data are analysed and published 2023 under the title \\'Blue LED traps and commercial lure improve Western Flower Thrips (Frankliniella occidentalis) monitoring in the greenhouse\\' in the Journal of Applied Entomology, https://doi.org/10.1007/s10340-024-01752-7  Detailed methods of data collection and analyses are desribed in the paper. The files were created by MS Excel 2016.".
