<http://localhost:5002/38638c74-9752-4a01-b570-f856a0ed67f8> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "* You can find the most recent solutions here: https://seafile.cloud.uni-hannover.de/d/b63a279079c64024ba1e/  Unconstrained GRACE Follow-On monthly gravity field solutions from K-band range-rates and kinematic orbits. Processing details can be found in the following article: Koch I., Duwe M., Flury J., Shabanloui A. (2021): Earth’s Time-Variable Gravity from GRACE Follow-On K-Band Range-Rates and Pseudo-Observed Orbits, Remote Sens. 2021, 13(9), 1766; https://doi.org/10.3390/rs13091766.".
<http://localhost:5002/38638c74-9752-4a01-b570-f856a0ed67f8> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "38638c74-9752-4a01-b570-f856a0ed67f8".
<http://localhost:5002/38638c74-9752-4a01-b570-f856a0ed67f8> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-08-12T10:07:51.521703"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/38638c74-9752-4a01-b570-f856a0ed67f8> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T10:07:51.521710"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/38638c74-9752-4a01-b570-f856a0ed67f8> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> <http://localhost:5002/organization/institut-fuer-erdmessung>.
<http://localhost:5002/38638c74-9752-4a01-b570-f856a0ed67f8> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://data.uni-hannover.de/dataset/luh-grace-fo-2020>.
<http://localhost:5002/38638c74-9752-4a01-b570-f856a0ed67f8> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/temporal> _:38638c74-9752-4a01-b570-f856a0ed67f8.
<http://localhost:5002/d23a56d5-09b5-4e4e-bf9a-7d2223214576> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>.
<http://localhost:5002/d23a56d5-09b5-4e4e-bf9a-7d2223214576> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2F27xsmm9e>.
<http://localhost:5002/d23a56d5-09b5-4e4e-bf9a-7d2223214576> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "MultiPoroX: Automated multi-material porosity analysis tool".
<http://localhost:5002/d23a56d5-09b5-4e4e-bf9a-7d2223214576> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset contains files related to _MultiPoroX_, an automated porosity analysis tool for multi-material parts. It includes: The source code as a MATLAB file, the code as a PDF document, the user-friendly interface as a PDF document, exemplary analysis results of a multi-material sample (316L/CuCrZr) for demonstration purposes.  __Used software:__ MATLAB® R2024b  __Used parameters for the porosity analysis:__  * __Resizing:__ None * __Histogramm Equal:__ 0.001 * __Threshold:__ 65  ![Exemplary demonstration of an analysis result of a multi-material specimen (316L/CuCrZr)](https://data.uni-hannover.de/dataset/159b3c3b-b640-44ac-bcb5-8affc20632b3/resource/cfb27240-9488-4798-be75-ac95dd57784f/download/multiporox_multimaterial_defects_examplary_demontration.png)  Exemplary demonstration of an analysis result of a multi-material specimen (316L/CuCrZr)   ### References Meyer, I., Glitt, L., & Lachmayer, R. (2026). *Additive manufacturing of multi-material parts – A porosity analysis of 316L/CuCrZr using an automated characterization approach.* Procedia CIRP, 36th CIRP Design Conference (CIRP Design 2026), 142, 558–563. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.procir.2026.05.308  Meyer, I., Glitt, L., Lachmayer, R. (2025). *Comparative data of ImageJ and MultiPoroX* [Data set]. LUIS. https://doi.org/10.25835/l047b9xo  Meyer, I., Oel, M., Ehlers, T., & Lachmayer, R. (2023). *Additive manufacturing of multi-material parts – Design guidelines for manufacturing of 316L/CuCrZr in laser powder bed fusion.* Heliyon, 9(8), e18301. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.heliyon.2023.e18301   ### Acknowledgments  The project ”*Additive Fertigung multimaterieller Komponenten zur nachhaltigen Energiewandlung*” was funded by the European Regional Development Fund (ERDF) and the state of Lower Saxony – Project number ZW 7-87011865.  The project ”*Major Research Instrumentation for integration of efficient effects in multi-material structural components*” was funded by the Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft (DFG - German Research Foundation) - Project number 445707542.".
<http://localhost:5002/d23a56d5-09b5-4e4e-bf9a-7d2223214576> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "d23a56d5-09b5-4e4e-bf9a-7d2223214576".
<http://localhost:5002/d23a56d5-09b5-4e4e-bf9a-7d2223214576> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-08-12T10:10:24.950003"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
