<http://localhost:5002/f852f438-1a12-4cc6-9411-b672480a5719> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> <http://localhost:5002/organization/institut-fur-festkorperphysik>.
<http://localhost:5002/f852f438-1a12-4cc6-9411-b672480a5719> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double>.
