<http://localhost:5002/ebf2122d-d0ce-4b60-a32e-8cf9406b0d08> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2F0042221>.
<http://localhost:5002/ebf2122d-d0ce-4b60-a32e-8cf9406b0d08> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Training data and models for cINN model updating of finite element beam models of wind turbine blades".
<http://localhost:5002/ebf2122d-d0ce-4b60-a32e-8cf9406b0d08> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The dataset is directly related to the GitHub-Repository: https://github.com/IWES-LUH/Beam-ModelUpdating-cINN It contains training data and finished models of the conditional Invertible Neural Network trained for model updating of wind turbine blades. The applied model is the 20m-DemoBlade of the SmartBlades2 research project.".
