<http://localhost:5002/694f3344-81dc-4a7f-b8a4-464202a95676> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>.
<http://localhost:5002/694f3344-81dc-4a7f-b8a4-464202a95676> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2Frsjz3w2k>.
<http://localhost:5002/694f3344-81dc-4a7f-b8a4-464202a95676> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Light microscopy data from a parameter study on 316L/CuCrZr multi-material specimens".
<http://localhost:5002/694f3344-81dc-4a7f-b8a4-464202a95676> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset was generated in the context of a parameter study in the paper: _Supplementary data of “Additive manufacturing of multi-material parts – Influence of process parameters on interfacial characterization of 316L/CuCrZr in laser powder bed fusion\\'_   It includes data of Light microscropy of 7 specimens with the following sample number: 1, 8, 24, 25, 32, 33, 40.  * __Materials:__ 316L (Carpenter Additive) and CuCrZr (Eckart TLS GmbH) * __PBF-LB Machine:__ Aconity MIDI+ equipped with an integrated Aerosint SPD Recoater V1.0 * __Mounting material:__ AB-Zenopox * __Grinding machine:__ Struers Tegramin-30 * __Light microscope:__ Olympus BX61 with DP74 camera  ![Exemplary light microscopy image of a 316L/CuCrZr multi-material sample (Sample 1)](https://data.uni-hannover.de/de/dataset/b42039da-ced8-4f90-8055-02f4c7c422d6/resource/1b79b228-2cf9-4be2-9ded-9fcdcfca6bce/download/exemplary_light_microscopy_image_sample1.png) Exemplary light microscopy image of a 316L/CuCrZr multi-material sample (Sample 1)  ### References  Meyer, I., Oel, M., Ehlers, T., & Lachmayer, R. (2023). *Additive manufacturing of multi-material parts – Design guidelines for manufacturing of 316L/CuCrZr in laser powder bed fusion*. Heliyon, 9(8), e18301. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.heliyon.2023.e18301  Ina Meyer, Roland Lachmayer (2025). *Additive manufacturing data from a parameter study on 316L/CuCrZr multi-material specimens* [Data set]. LUIS. https://doi.org/10.25835/7p6wv6cg  Ina Meyer, Roland Lachmayer (2025). *µCT data from a parameter study on 316L/CuCrZr multi-material specimens* [Data set]. LUIS. https://doi.org/10.25835/bi1jbiq9  Ina Meyer, Roland Lachmayer (2025). *SEM data from a parameter study on 316L/CuCrZr multi-material specimens* [Data set]. LUIS. https://doi.org/10.25835/wan2sabi  ### Acknowledgments  The project ”*Additive Fertigung multimaterieller Komponenten zur nachhaltigen Energiewandlung*” was funded by the European Regional Development Fund (ERDF) and the state of Lower Saxony – Project number ZW 7-87011865.  The project ”*Major Research Instrumentation for integration of efficient effects in multi-material structural components*” was funded by the Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft (DFG - German Research Foundation) - Project number 445707542.".
