<http://localhost:5002/7342867d-e0a8-4c29-82e6-9acd505616d4> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2Fdr0bu9oq>.
<http://localhost:5002/7342867d-e0a8-4c29-82e6-9acd505616d4> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Cantilever Beam Dataset for Structural Change Localisation".
<http://localhost:5002/7342867d-e0a8-4c29-82e6-9acd505616d4> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The dataset contains measurement data, a numerical model, and identified modal properties of a cantilever beam structure. Different mass configurations were applied to the structure using magnetic attachments with varying positions and weights. In total, measurements with a duration of five minutes were conducted for 35 structural states. The dataset is designed for the application of model-based damage localisation approaches.".
