<http://localhost:5002/e4584191-56d3-4161-b2db-0ed8c148bf0e> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2Fbi1jbiq9>.
<http://localhost:5002/e4584191-56d3-4161-b2db-0ed8c148bf0e> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "µCT data from a parameter study on 316L/CuCrZr multi-material specimens".
<http://localhost:5002/e4584191-56d3-4161-b2db-0ed8c148bf0e> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset was generated in the context of a parameter study in the paper: _Supplementary data of “Additive manufacturing of multi-material parts – Influence of process parameters on interface formation in in-plane 316L/CuCrZr laser powder bed fusion\\'_   It includes data of CT-scans of 14 specimens with the following sample number: 1, 8, 10, 15 (3x), 16, 24, 25, 26, 31, 32, 33, 40.  * __Materials:__ 316L (Carpenter Additive) and CuCrZr (Eckart TLS GmbH) * __PBF-LB Machine:__ Aconity MIDI+ equipped with an integrated Aerosint SPD Recoater V1.0 * __µCT Scanner:__ Bruker SkyScan 1275 * __Result Image Width:__ 1944 pixels * __Result Image Height:__ 1944 pixels  ![ Exemplary computed tomography image of a 316L/CuCrZr multi-material sample (Sample 1)](https://data.uni-hannover.de/de/dataset/fb2dd8d5-ff72-4e73-bb6d-e942b3c288f6/resource/db9251a0-4a7a-443e-b51e-d21b0f2ce788/download/exemplary_ct_sample_1.jpg) Exemplary computed tomography image of a 316L/CuCrZr multi-material sample (Sample 1)  ### References  Meyer, I., Oel, M., Ehlers, T., & Lachmayer, R. (2023). *Additive manufacturing of multi-material parts – Design guidelines for manufacturing of 316L/CuCrZr in laser powder bed fusion*. Heliyon, 9(8), e18301. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.heliyon.2023.e18301  Ina Meyer, Cameron Owen Messmann, Roland Lachmayer (2026). *CT-based porosity analysis of 316L/CuCrZr multi-material specimens* [Data set]. LUIS. https://doi.org/10.25835/wzrn3izc  Ina Meyer, Roland Lachmayer (2025). *Additive manufacturing data from a parameter study on 316L/CuCrZr multi-material specimens* [Data set]. LUIS. https://doi.org/10.25835/7p6wv6cg  Ina Meyer, Roland Lachmayer (2025). *Light microscopy data from a parameter study on 316L/CuCrZr multi-material specimens* [Data set]. LUIS. https://doi.org/10.25835/rsjz3w2k  Ina Meyer, Roland Lachmayer (2025). *SEM data from a parameter study on 316L/CuCrZr multi-material specimens* [Data set]. LUIS. https://doi.org/10.25835/wan2sabi  ### Acknowledgments  The project ”*Additive Fertigung multimaterieller Komponenten zur nachhaltigen Energiewandlung*” was funded by the European Regional Development Fund (ERDF) and the state of Lower Saxony – Project number ZW 7-87011865.  The project ”*Major Research Instrumentation for integration of efficient effects in multi-material structural components*” was funded by the Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft (DFG - German Research Foundation) - Project number 445707542.".
