<http://localhost:5002/15ce7a6e-bdde-443e-8a28-c88dacb5ca2b> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "All data are analysed under the title \\'Conservation of non-pest whiteflies and natural enemies of the cabbage whitefly Aleyrodes proletella on perennial plants for use in non-crop habitats\\' published in the journal Insects 2021, 12, 774; https://doi.org/10.3390/insects12090774  Detailed methods of data collection and analyses are desribed in the paper. The files were created by MS Excel 2016.".
