<http://localhost:5002/574c5038-3016-472b-9205-acab3f56e9a9> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Leaf age is important for assessment of resistance in Chrysanthemum against Frankliniella occidentalis".
<http://localhost:5002/574c5038-3016-472b-9205-acab3f56e9a9> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "All data are analysed and published 2020 under the title \\'Leaf age is important for assessment of resistance in Chrysanthemum against Frankliniella occidentalis\\' in the Journal of Plant Diseases and Protection (2021) 128:511–516; https://doi.org/10.1007/s41348-020-00402-1  Detailed methods of data collection and analyses are desribed in the paper. The files were created by MS Excel 2016.".
<http://localhost:5002/574c5038-3016-472b-9205-acab3f56e9a9> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "574c5038-3016-472b-9205-acab3f56e9a9".
<http://localhost:5002/574c5038-3016-472b-9205-acab3f56e9a9> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-08-12T10:04:04.070669"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/574c5038-3016-472b-9205-acab3f56e9a9> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T10:04:04.070678"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/574c5038-3016-472b-9205-acab3f56e9a9> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> <http://localhost:5002/organization/institut-fur-gartenbauliche-produktionssysteme>.
<http://localhost:5002/574c5038-3016-472b-9205-acab3f56e9a9> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double>.
