<http://localhost:5002/e80ff49b-b18a-4750-a506-c81bd1e14ec1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Pre-trained dom2vec protein domain embeddings used for downstream evaluation discussed in  \\'dom2vec: Capturing domain structure and function using self-supervision on protein domain architectures\\' (bioRxiv manuscript: [link](https://www.biorxiv.org/content/10.1101/2020.03.17.995498v2)).  The domain embeddings were trained using the annotations of InterPro db version 75.0.".
