<http://localhost:5002/4f4ed1e7-d06f-483c-bc7a-56933a728652> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-08-12T09:57:29.845525"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/4f4ed1e7-d06f-483c-bc7a-56933a728652> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T09:57:29.845530"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/4f4ed1e7-d06f-483c-bc7a-56933a728652> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> <http://localhost:5002/organization/institut-fur-thermodynamik>.
