<http://localhost:5002/a25e679e-1395-4faf-b3dd-8f7b73d759ab> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2Fhjn2qcvy>.
<http://localhost:5002/a25e679e-1395-4faf-b3dd-8f7b73d759ab> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Rheology Data of Lubrizol Carbopol ETD2020".
<http://localhost:5002/a25e679e-1395-4faf-b3dd-8f7b73d759ab> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "All measurements taken with Modular Compact Series of Anton Paar AG rheometer at Institut für Transport- und Automatisierungstechnik (ITA) of the Leibniz Universität Hannover (LUH).  All measurements taken by Lennart Mesecke @IPeG under supervision of Tobias Biermann @IPeG.  The material was analyzed regarding viscosity und shear stress under given shear rates.".
<http://localhost:5002/a25e679e-1395-4faf-b3dd-8f7b73d759ab> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "a25e679e-1395-4faf-b3dd-8f7b73d759ab".
<http://localhost:5002/a25e679e-1395-4faf-b3dd-8f7b73d759ab> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-08-12T10:17:27.473785"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
