<http://localhost:5002/b1de4ed7-381d-4a1d-a71f-75ece27ee9d7> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Replication File for Reversal of Economic Integration".
<http://localhost:5002/b1de4ed7-381d-4a1d-a71f-75ece27ee9d7> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This Replication Package contains all data and do files to replicate the tables and graphs in the paper \\'Reversal of Economic Integration: Evidence from EU Enlargement\\' by Hinnerk Gnutzmann, Arevik Gnutzmann-Mkrtchyan, and Tobias Korn, published in the Scandinavian Journal of Economics 2025.".
<http://localhost:5002/b1de4ed7-381d-4a1d-a71f-75ece27ee9d7> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "b1de4ed7-381d-4a1d-a71f-75ece27ee9d7".
