<http://localhost:5002/e0cab8ea-01be-47fc-a2a5-ed8d3cd79f02> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2F6vi6iwzd>.
<http://localhost:5002/e0cab8ea-01be-47fc-a2a5-ed8d3cd79f02> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Phenolic compounds in different stages of ontogenesis in Chrysanthemum - a potential for thrips-resistance characterisation".
<http://localhost:5002/e0cab8ea-01be-47fc-a2a5-ed8d3cd79f02> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "All data are analysed and published 2024 under the title \\'Phenolic compounds in different stages of ontogenesis in Chrysanthemum - a potential for thrips-resistance characterisation\\' in the Journal ?; doi:?  Detailed methods of data collection and analyses are desribed in the paper. The files were created by MS Excel 2016.".
