<http://localhost:5002/b0e48da4-39a7-4f92-b9f6-a44995cc0361> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset provides the research data for the paper \\'On the Design and Operation of the Thermal Management System of PEMFC-Powered Aircraft\\' by Marius Nozinski, Patrick Meyer, Fabian Delony, Jens Friedrichs, Jan Göing, and Stephan Kabelac. DOI: https://doi.org/10.3390/aerospace13030243. It contains the simulation data associated with the figures shown in the paper. Please cite the paper when using this data. Acknowledgements: We would like to acknowledge the funding by the Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft (DFG, German Research Foundation) under Germany\\'s Excellence Strategy - EXC 2163/1 - Sustainable and Energy Efficient Aviation - Project-ID 390881007.".
