<http://localhost:5002/efd97d66-cc4b-4253-ac24-96285d7e07f2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2Fpngok8op>.
<http://localhost:5002/efd97d66-cc4b-4253-ac24-96285d7e07f2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Micro-Topo-Dataset".
<http://localhost:5002/efd97d66-cc4b-4253-ac24-96285d7e07f2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset contains microscopic RGB-D measurements of various topographies. The data was acquired using a Keyence VK-X210 confocal laser scanning microscope. A CSV file contains the metadata for all measurements, while the raw data for each measurement is stored as an npy file. Furthermore, each measurement contains the following: * a height image * a laser intensity image * an RGB image * a combined laser intensity + RGB image. Lastly, display_dataset.ipynb is included as a demo to load the CSV and display measurement data.".
