<http://localhost:5002/76105691-1b3e-4488-bf1c-05e4bb934105> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>.
<http://localhost:5002/76105691-1b3e-4488-bf1c-05e4bb934105> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2F0072357>.
<http://localhost:5002/76105691-1b3e-4488-bf1c-05e4bb934105> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Megathrust Stress Drop as Trigger of Aftershock Seismicity: Insights From the 2011 Tohoku Earthquake, Japan".
<http://localhost:5002/76105691-1b3e-4488-bf1c-05e4bb934105> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This data repository contains the data to the publication \\'Megathrust Stress Drop as Trigger of Aftershock Seismicity: Insights From the 2011 Tohoku Earthquake, Japan\\' by A. Dielforder, G. M. Bocchini, K. Kemna, A. Hampel, R. M. Harrington, and O. Oncken. https://doi.org/10.1029/2022GL101320".
<http://localhost:5002/76105691-1b3e-4488-bf1c-05e4bb934105> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "76105691-1b3e-4488-bf1c-05e4bb934105".
<http://localhost:5002/76105691-1b3e-4488-bf1c-05e4bb934105> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-08-12T08:11:29.096063"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
