<http://localhost:5002/28198a36-eb95-40f5-92d3-2ca143749ea2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This data repository contains the Extended MP-16 (EMP-16) dataset introduced in the paper: > Theiner, J., Müller-Budack, E., & Ewerth, R. (2022). Interpretable Semantic Photo Geolocation. In Proceedings of the IEEE/CVF Winter Conference on Applications of Computer Vision (pp. 750-760).  <div align=\\'center\\'>    [![Conference](https://img.shields.io/badge/WACV-2022-6b8bc7.svg?style=for-the-badge)](https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/WACV2022/html/Theiner_Interpretable_Semantic_Photo_Geolocation_WACV_2022_paper.html) [![arXiv](https://img.shields.io/badge/arXiv-2104.14995-b31b1b.svg?style=for-the-badge)](https://arxiv.org/abs/2104.14995) </div>  ## Documentation & Source Code See https://github.com/jtheiner/semantic_geo_partitioning#extended-mp-16-dataset-emp-16 ## License [Open Data Commons Open Database License (ODbL)](https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/)".
