<http://localhost:5002/f1ea0b7b-e429-49d3-a478-90a521b61e2f> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2Fog5nute0>.
<http://localhost:5002/f1ea0b7b-e429-49d3-a478-90a521b61e2f> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Online convex optimization for robust control of constrained dynamical systems".
<http://localhost:5002/f1ea0b7b-e429-49d3-a478-90a521b61e2f> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "We provide supplementary code material to our recent paper \\'Online convex optimization for robust control of constrained dynamical systems\\' https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2401.04487  The provided matlab code contains a simulation example of a tracking control problem of an autonomous vehicle. To reproduce the results, you can run the file \\'autonomous_car.m\\'. Note that the mpt3 toolbox and the casadi toolbox are required to run the code, see https://www.mpt3.org/ and https://web.casadi.org/ for details.".
<http://localhost:5002/f1ea0b7b-e429-49d3-a478-90a521b61e2f> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "f1ea0b7b-e429-49d3-a478-90a521b61e2f".
<http://localhost:5002/f1ea0b7b-e429-49d3-a478-90a521b61e2f> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-08-12T10:11:49.219916"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
