<http://localhost:5002/f1ea0b7b-e429-49d3-a478-90a521b61e2f> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/temporal> _:f1ea0b7b-e429-49d3-a478-90a521b61e2f.
<http://localhost:5002/420fe2c1-1309-4e0d-9cbc-689df4c4848d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>.
<http://localhost:5002/420fe2c1-1309-4e0d-9cbc-689df4c4848d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2F0017692>.
<http://localhost:5002/420fe2c1-1309-4e0d-9cbc-689df4c4848d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Banker plants promote functional biodiversity and decrease populations of the cabbage whitefly Aleyrodes proletella".
<http://localhost:5002/420fe2c1-1309-4e0d-9cbc-689df4c4848d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "All data are analysed and published 2020 under the title \\'Banker plants promote functional biodiversity and decrease populations of the cabbage whitefly Aleyrodes proletella\\' in the Journal of Applied Entomolgoy; https://doi.org/10.1111/jen.12831  Detailed methods of data collection and analyses are desribed in the paper. The files were created by MS Excel 2016.".
<http://localhost:5002/420fe2c1-1309-4e0d-9cbc-689df4c4848d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "420fe2c1-1309-4e0d-9cbc-689df4c4848d".
<http://localhost:5002/420fe2c1-1309-4e0d-9cbc-689df4c4848d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-08-12T09:49:26.449107"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/420fe2c1-1309-4e0d-9cbc-689df4c4848d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T09:49:26.449113"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/420fe2c1-1309-4e0d-9cbc-689df4c4848d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> <http://localhost:5002/organization/institut-fur-gartenbauliche-produktionssysteme>.
