<http://localhost:5002/420fe2c1-1309-4e0d-9cbc-689df4c4848d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/temporal> _:420fe2c1-1309-4e0d-9cbc-689df4c4848d.
<http://localhost:5002/12261851-f1ca-4296-a83c-abb9e33f08ee> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>.
<http://localhost:5002/12261851-f1ca-4296-a83c-abb9e33f08ee> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2Fb5xmxmbn>.
<http://localhost:5002/12261851-f1ca-4296-a83c-abb9e33f08ee> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "VLBI residuals".
<http://localhost:5002/12261851-f1ca-4296-a83c-abb9e33f08ee> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset contains VLBI residuals derived from group delay analysis using the VieVS VLBI analysis software \\citep{Boehm2018}. The residuals are based on 31 VGOS-OPS sessions (VO4003–VO4346) provided by the International VLBI Service (IVS) in 2024.  The least-squares analysis includes estimates of:  Troposphere parameters (zenith wet delays and gradients as piecewise linear offsets with 30-min and 3-h intervals, respectively).  Station clock behavior (rate, quadratic term, and hourly offsets).  Earth orientation parameters (polar motion, UT1–UTC, celestial pole offsets).  Station coordinates (tied to ITRF2020; \\citealt{Altamimi2023}).  Source coordinates (tied to ICRF3; \\citealt{Charlot2020}).  The stochastic model applies elevation-dependent weighting following \\citet{Krasna2023}, while other modeling choices follow the IERS Conventions \\citep{Petit2010}.  The residual analysis focuses on four geodetic VLBI stations: ONSA13NE (Sweden), WETTZ13S (Germany), MACGO12M (Texas, USA), and WESTFORD (Massachusetts, USA). These stations represent baselines of ~900 km (Europe) and ~3000 km (USA) and are known for their stable instrumentation and long-term geodetic data quality.".
<http://localhost:5002/12261851-f1ca-4296-a83c-abb9e33f08ee> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "12261851-f1ca-4296-a83c-abb9e33f08ee".
<http://localhost:5002/12261851-f1ca-4296-a83c-abb9e33f08ee> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-08-12T10:28:34.975034"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/12261851-f1ca-4296-a83c-abb9e33f08ee> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T10:28:34.975040"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/12261851-f1ca-4296-a83c-abb9e33f08ee> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> <http://localhost:5002/organization/institut-fuer-meteorologie-und-klimatologie>.
