<http://localhost:5002/abc89700-112f-4673-8097-02a9087aef31> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "COVID-19 Image Repository".
<http://localhost:5002/abc89700-112f-4673-8097-02a9087aef31> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This project aims to create an anonymized data set of COVID-19 cases with a focus on radiological imaging. This includes images with extensive metadata, such as admission-, ICU-, laboratory-, and patient master-data.  This repository contains image data from the Institute for Diagnostic and Interventional Radiology, Hannover Medical School, Hannover, Germany.".
