<http://localhost:5002/769bb6d7-93dd-42c3-a803-3240f4aab26f> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Toward Large-Eddy Simulations of Dust Devils of Observed Intensity: Effects of Grid Spacing, Background Wind, and Surface Heterogeneities".
<http://localhost:5002/769bb6d7-93dd-42c3-a803-3240f4aab26f> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This data contain all relevant model steering, output, plot, and analysis files that were used to create the publication \\'Toward Large-Eddy Simulations of Dust Devils of Observed Intensity: Effects of Grid Spacing, Background Wind, and Surface Heterogeneities\\' in the journal JGR:Atmosphere.".
