<http://localhost:5002/ece863a1-2fed-46b9-8194-198e9aec807d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "LED traps enhance monitoring of Trialeurodes vaporariorum in greenhouse grown tomato".
<http://localhost:5002/ece863a1-2fed-46b9-8194-198e9aec807d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "All data are analysed and published 2024 under the title \\'Whitefly detected: LED traps enhance monitoring of Trialeurodes vaporariorum in greenhouse grown tomato\\' in the Journal Horticulturae, 10 (9), 960. https://doi.org/10.3390/horticulturae10090960  Detailed methods of data collection and analyses are desribed in the paper. The files were created by MS Excel 2016.".
