<http://localhost:5002/c89f782a-0d5e-4e3b-9687-86b433b6d26c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>.
<http://localhost:5002/c89f782a-0d5e-4e3b-9687-86b433b6d26c> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2F0082741>.
<http://localhost:5002/c89f782a-0d5e-4e3b-9687-86b433b6d26c> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "i.c.sens Multi-view pedestrian tracking dataset".
<http://localhost:5002/c89f782a-0d5e-4e3b-9687-86b433b6d26c> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset was acquired for the purpose of collaborative pedestrian tracking from multiple viewpoints. This dataset consists of 29 image sequences which capture trajectories of pedestrians from three different viewpoints with three stereo camera pairs. Each captured image pair(left and right) has a global timestamp. The coressponding image sequences in different views have the same sequence number. The identity number of a pedestrian is unique and identical across viewpoints.  Example tracking results in the first viewpoint and the annotated pedestrians from the other two views: ![example](https://data.uni-hannover.de/dataset/733e368e-a481-4f85-8aac-2abcc35a0673/resource/ae60e256-a8a9-4f83-ad47-2c8824da7bc2/download/eaxmple_tracking_result.png \\'example tracking results\\')  The following \\'.zip\\' packets are provided for data set usage: <ol> <li> 1. Rectified stereo images captured from three viewpoints, each image has a global timestamp. </li> <li> 2. The calibration parameters (both intrinsic and extrinsic) of each stereo camera pairs are stored in \\'calibration.zip\\' which allows computing the 3D position in the global coordinate of a pixel in image space. </li> <li> 3. Ground truth annotations of pedestrians appearing in the left image of a stereo are provided for a number of image sequences. </li> </ol>  The details of how to use all these data and information are described in the \\'read_me.txt\\' of each \\'.zip\\' packet".
<http://localhost:5002/c89f782a-0d5e-4e3b-9687-86b433b6d26c> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "c89f782a-0d5e-4e3b-9687-86b433b6d26c".
<http://localhost:5002/c89f782a-0d5e-4e3b-9687-86b433b6d26c> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-08-12T10:10:19.209206"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/c89f782a-0d5e-4e3b-9687-86b433b6d26c> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T10:10:19.209214"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/c89f782a-0d5e-4e3b-9687-86b433b6d26c> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> <http://localhost:5002/organization/i-c-sens>.
<http://localhost:5002/c89f782a-0d5e-4e3b-9687-86b433b6d26c> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://data.uni-hannover.de/dataset/multi-view-pedestrian-tracking>.
<http://localhost:5002/c89f782a-0d5e-4e3b-9687-86b433b6d26c> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/temporal> _:c89f782a-0d5e-4e3b-9687-86b433b6d26c.
<http://localhost:5002/55c85ff5-006b-4e69-ac9d-8a010255a93a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>.
<http://localhost:5002/55c85ff5-006b-4e69-ac9d-8a010255a93a> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2F8eitlrmr>.
<http://localhost:5002/55c85ff5-006b-4e69-ac9d-8a010255a93a> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Algorithmic workflows for the design of internal structures to enhance the thermal performance".
<http://localhost:5002/55c85ff5-006b-4e69-ac9d-8a010255a93a> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset contains two algorithmic workflows for the design of internal structures aimed at enhancing thermal performance.  One script follows a strut-based approach (*strut_based_algorithm.gh*), while the other employs mathematical functions to describe the surface geometry (*mathematical_based_algorithm.gh*).  Supplementary data for *\\'__Design of Internal Structures to Enhance the Thermal Performance of Additively Manufactured Heat Exchangers__.\\'*  Both workflows were developed and tested using the following software:  * __Grasshopper__ 1.0.0007 * __Rhino__ Version 7 SR37  Required plugins:  * __Axolotl__ (2021-05-19) * __IntraLattice__ (0.8.1)".
<http://localhost:5002/55c85ff5-006b-4e69-ac9d-8a010255a93a> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "55c85ff5-006b-4e69-ac9d-8a010255a93a".
