<http://localhost:5002/6d3117ea-4ccc-46f6-bf10-68105d47eaf1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T09:59:05.494320"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
