<http://localhost:5002/f18a9419-8008-4091-8fc4-9c12d720401d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>.
<http://localhost:5002/f18a9419-8008-4091-8fc4-9c12d720401d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2F3kayukbq>.
<http://localhost:5002/f18a9419-8008-4091-8fc4-9c12d720401d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "CSP Solution Environment".
<http://localhost:5002/f18a9419-8008-4091-8fc4-9c12d720401d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The published artifact is a Python implemented constraint solver. The AC-3 was implemented as constraint propagation algorithm and the backtracking, backjumping, forward checking as well as the maintanance arc consistency algorithm as search algorithms.".
<http://localhost:5002/f18a9419-8008-4091-8fc4-9c12d720401d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "f18a9419-8008-4091-8fc4-9c12d720401d".
