<http://localhost:5002/4745f03a-6a7b-4107-a15d-491b3c1f0bc7> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "All data are analysed and published 2023 under the title \\'Blue and UV light-emitting diodes (LEDs) disturb the greenhouse whitefly (Trialeurodes vaporariorum) from its host\\' in the Journal of Pest Science; https://doi.org/10.1007/s10340-023-01693-7  Detailed methods of data collection and analyses are desribed in the paper. The files were created by MS Excel 2016.".
