<http://localhost:5002/c6b9c60c-8d15-43ae-936b-f6b513152b0e> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "A gradient-enhanced bone remodelling approach to avoid the checkerboard phenomenon".
<http://localhost:5002/c6b9c60c-8d15-43ae-936b-f6b513152b0e> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Abaqus User Element (UEL) subroutine from the paper: Bensel, Reiber et al. (2023) \\'A gradient-enhanced bone remodelling approach to avoid the checkerboard phenomenon\\', Computational Mechanics, Springer, https://doi.org/10.1007/s00466-023-02413-9   The subroutine includes: adapted C3D4 implementation with an additional degree of freedom, stress adaptive bone remodelling material with gradient enhancement regularisation and User Material subroutine for visualization.".
