<http://localhost:5002/0f586b10-09b9-47e0-ad3d-17524e5f2d1d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This data contain all relevant model steering, output, plot, and analysis files that were used to create the publication \\'Evolution and Features of Dust Devil-Like Vortices in Turbulent Rayleigh–Bénard Convection - A Numerical Study using Direct Numerical Simulation\\' in the journal JGR:Atmosphere.".
