<http://localhost:5002/83ad97d1-1575-41d5-aa94-c09cd5c1fd4d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/temporal> _:83ad97d1-1575-41d5-aa94-c09cd5c1fd4d.
<http://localhost:5002/11167924-96b3-4703-b37e-25c8f047653b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>.
<http://localhost:5002/11167924-96b3-4703-b37e-25c8f047653b> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2Ferbbvx5h>.
<http://localhost:5002/11167924-96b3-4703-b37e-25c8f047653b> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "ICF IFAC 2023 Videos".
<http://localhost:5002/11167924-96b3-4703-b37e-25c8f047653b> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "In this repository, we provide the video files that show the simulations of the paper:  Marvin Becker, Philipp Caspers, Tom Hattendorf, Torsten Lilge, Sami Haddadin, and Matthias A. Müller. “Informed Circular Fields for Global Reactive Obstacle Avoidance of Robotic Manipulators”. In: IFAC-PapersOnLine 56.2 (2023), pp. 1017–1022.  doi: 10.1016/j.ifacol.2023.10.1698.  Each scenario is represented by one exemplary video for each planner. We also added two videos showing failed attempts of our ICF planner. The videos can be downloaded together as a zip. file or viewed in your browser.".
<http://localhost:5002/11167924-96b3-4703-b37e-25c8f047653b> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "11167924-96b3-4703-b37e-25c8f047653b".
