<http://localhost:5002/93b0249f-2a3e-4d2f-a900-1c3c4469617d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2Fzmlriehg>.
<http://localhost:5002/93b0249f-2a3e-4d2f-a900-1c3c4469617d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "An efficient data-based off-policy Q-learning algorithm for optimal output feedback control of linear systems".
<http://localhost:5002/93b0249f-2a3e-4d2f-a900-1c3c4469617d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "We provide supplementary code material to our recent paper \\'An efficient data-based off-policy Q-learning algorithm for optimal output feedback control of linear systems\\'.  The provided matlab codes contain a comparison between our proposed Qlearning algorithm and an existing SDP-based method. To reproduce the results of Table I, you can run the file \\'comparison_QL_SDP.m\\'. Note that CVX is required to run the SDP-based method, see (http://cvxr.com/cvx/) for details.".
<http://localhost:5002/93b0249f-2a3e-4d2f-a900-1c3c4469617d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "93b0249f-2a3e-4d2f-a900-1c3c4469617d".
