<http://localhost:5002/251e8a5d-a200-4ae6-81de-a0473d1daced> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The txt-files contain atom numbers recorded in the Rb-87 hyperfine states |F=2, m=0> and |F=1, m=0>. As well as relevant experimental parameters.  The data is given in csv-format. The first line contains descriptive column headers.".
