<http://localhost:5002/aa5bb477-4e64-4eb7-925f-5bb1aa863110> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://data.uni-hannover.de/dataset/influence-of-training-parameters-for-ipinn-accuracy-in-shape-sensing>.
