<http://localhost:5002/d577597a-7aa0-450d-827a-6ce7ad1dd400> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-08-12T10:11:59.990602"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
