<http://localhost:5002/61b8bb80-786f-4e17-b97c-666262ad84cc> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Wake properties and power output of very large wind farms in the German Bight".
<http://localhost:5002/61b8bb80-786f-4e17-b97c-666262ad84cc> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "# PALM input files and plot scripts  ## PALM input files  The input files for the precursor and main simulations can be found in the directory *SteeringFiles*. They include:  - a steering file for the initial run (p3d) and the restart run (p3dr) - a file  that describes the aerodynamic blade properties of the IEA 15 MW wind turbine (_wtm) - a static driver (NetCDF file) that describes the wind turbine coordinates and other turbine parameters (_wtmpar) - In case SBL-300-7D a large scale forcing file that describes the temperature advection tendencies (_lsf)  The PALM code is available at https://palm.muk.uni-hannover.de  ## Plot scripts  The plot scripts are written in Python 3 and can be found in the directory *PlotScripts*.".
<http://localhost:5002/61b8bb80-786f-4e17-b97c-666262ad84cc> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "61b8bb80-786f-4e17-b97c-666262ad84cc".
<http://localhost:5002/61b8bb80-786f-4e17-b97c-666262ad84cc> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-08-12T10:28:49.908137"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/61b8bb80-786f-4e17-b97c-666262ad84cc> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T10:28:49.908145"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/61b8bb80-786f-4e17-b97c-666262ad84cc> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> <http://localhost:5002/organization/institut-fuer-meteorologie-und-klimatologie>.
