<http://localhost:5002/09e95bfc-e25a-4973-baea-649de99153f4> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-08-12T10:29:09.306361"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/09e95bfc-e25a-4973-baea-649de99153f4> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T10:29:09.306368"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
