<http://localhost:5002/a37aa80b-c6f0-4a47-8d67-93f1c0fff5d3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2Fuwrcesyr>.
<http://localhost:5002/a37aa80b-c6f0-4a47-8d67-93f1c0fff5d3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Measurement data and BayOMA identification results of a 31 m wind turbine rotor blade".
<http://localhost:5002/a37aa80b-c6f0-4a47-8d67-93f1c0fff5d3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The presented dataset contains measurement data and the corresponding modal parameters eigenfrequencies and eigenmodes identified using Bayesian operational modal analysis (BayOMA) of a 31 m wind turbine rotor blade tested under fatigue loading. More information is available in the readme file.  The dataset is published alongside the article \\'Damage identification on a large-scale wind turbine rotor blade using sample-based deterministic model updating\\' by Wolniak et al., submitted to Wind Energy Science in October 2025.".
