<http://localhost:5002/9da758ea-1826-4b64-9885-2a5ccd654259> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Replication: An Evaluation of the Security and Usability of Multi-Factor Authentication Recovery".
<http://localhost:5002/9da758ea-1826-4b64-9885-2a5ccd654259> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This repository contains the replication package for our CCS\\'23 paper \\'“We’ve Disabled MFA for You”: An Evaluation of the Security and Usability of Multi-Factor Authentication Recovery Deployments\\', including: - a list of all websites in our final sample - tables with more detailed information regarding our analyzed websites - codebooks used by the authors to categorize findings - additional text templates, such as the initial help request and the debriefing email - additional graphics with more information".
<http://localhost:5002/9da758ea-1826-4b64-9885-2a5ccd654259> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "9da758ea-1826-4b64-9885-2a5ccd654259".
<http://localhost:5002/9da758ea-1826-4b64-9885-2a5ccd654259> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-08-12T10:16:58.841438"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
