<http://localhost:5002/737c2c1b-1e5e-4e5f-8b8f-72bc019802a5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-08-12T10:19:37.610341"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/737c2c1b-1e5e-4e5f-8b8f-72bc019802a5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T10:19:37.610347"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/737c2c1b-1e5e-4e5f-8b8f-72bc019802a5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> <http://localhost:5002/organization/institut-fur-fertigungstechnik-und-werkzeugmaschinen>.
