<http://localhost:5002/a874bfe1-53d8-4768-b4a0-49706ac8aa89> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>.
<http://localhost:5002/a874bfe1-53d8-4768-b4a0-49706ac8aa89> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2F0026044>.
<http://localhost:5002/a874bfe1-53d8-4768-b4a0-49706ac8aa89> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Supplementary data for the final report of DFG project 290141559".
<http://localhost:5002/a874bfe1-53d8-4768-b4a0-49706ac8aa89> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This set provides supplementary data for the final report of the DFG project \\'Untersuchung des kombinierten Einflusses des Dressierens und Rollenrichtens von Dünnblech aus Materialien mit unterschiedlichem Kristallgitter auf die Mikrostruktur, Textur, statische und Ermüdungsfestigkeit\\' (project number 290141559).   - 290141559_tensile_data.zip   The data set includes tensile test data for DC01, copper, and titanium in the initial condition and after different bending loads.   - 290141559_hysteresis_data.zip   The data set includes cyclic hysteresis data for DC01, copper, and titanium for different skin passing loads.   - 290141559_cyclic_bending_XRD.zip   The data set includes XRD texture data for DC01, copper, and titanium after different bending loads.".
<http://localhost:5002/a874bfe1-53d8-4768-b4a0-49706ac8aa89> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "a874bfe1-53d8-4768-b4a0-49706ac8aa89".
<http://localhost:5002/a874bfe1-53d8-4768-b4a0-49706ac8aa89> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-08-12T10:22:53.270783"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/a874bfe1-53d8-4768-b4a0-49706ac8aa89> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T10:22:53.270789"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
