<http://localhost:5002/d7efe2b4-9d26-4640-8195-a45325729ff3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Source-code: Corrosion-Fatigue Degradation in Reinforced Concrete Structures".
<http://localhost:5002/d7efe2b4-9d26-4640-8195-a45325729ff3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "FEniCSx code for the multiphysics computational framework for corrosion-fatigue in reinforced concrete: This open-access computational code is developed to implement the proposed holistic multiphysics phase-field framework for corrosion–fatigue interaction in reinforced concrete structures. The code provides a unified numerical platform for simulating the coupled chemo-mechanical degradation processes governing the durability of reinforced concrete under aggressive environmental exposure and cyclic mechanical loading.".
