<http://localhost:5002/fe4346cb-e22b-410c-9a04-878babfc047f> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2F0ugtwxbm>.
<http://localhost:5002/fe4346cb-e22b-410c-9a04-878babfc047f> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "PLR Latency Benchmark".
<http://localhost:5002/fe4346cb-e22b-410c-9a04-878babfc047f> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Code repository for the Paper \\'Model-based comparison of latency estimation methods for the pupillary light reflex\\'. This code enables the evaluation and comparison of various latency detection methods for the pupillary light reflex using synthetic data with controlled conditions.".
