<http://localhost:5002/7acaec49-93ec-406b-899b-7b63d9bfbab7> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Confocal scans and spectroscopic measurement data of over 6000 automatically selected fluorescent spots in hexagonal boron nitride samples. Information about the experiment and data structure is contained in the info_data-structure.pdf.".
