<http://localhost:5002/de72944b-535d-4e35-913d-99125e7c57b3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/temporal> _:de72944b-535d-4e35-913d-99125e7c57b3.
<http://localhost:5002/8d4112e0-b133-4df7-b778-6f462d157610> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>.
<http://localhost:5002/8d4112e0-b133-4df7-b778-6f462d157610> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2Fbbt5vgdo>.
<http://localhost:5002/8d4112e0-b133-4df7-b778-6f462d157610> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Exploring the effectiveness of methyl salicylate and attractive traps in dispersing and recapturing greenhouse whiteflies: advances in push-pull strategy".
<http://localhost:5002/8d4112e0-b133-4df7-b778-6f462d157610> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "All data are analysed and published 2024 under the title \\'Exploring the effectiveness of methyl salicylate and attractive traps in dispersing and recapturing greenhouse whiteflies: advances in push-pull strategy.\\' in the Journal Pest Management Science; doi: 10.1002/ps.70021  Detailed methods of data collection and analyses are desribed in the paper. The files were created by MS Excel 2016.".
