<http://localhost:5002/43e9710b-b902-418a-8d0b-13666c2f3c0d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2Faj8z6qly>.
<http://localhost:5002/43e9710b-b902-418a-8d0b-13666c2f3c0d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "CAD data of additively manufactured components for a hydrogen-fueled combined heat and power plant".
<http://localhost:5002/43e9710b-b902-418a-8d0b-13666c2f3c0d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "# Description This data set contains CAD data for three different components that are planned for use in a hydrogen-fueled CHP plant. These components are a cylinder liner with internal cooling channels, a cooling water-jacketed free-form exhaust manifold, and an inlay with an internal cooling channel for retrofitting cylinder heads. The design was created in Autodesk Inventor and additive manufacturing was carried out on an EOS M280. The CAD data is available in .ipt and manufacturer-neutral .step file formats.  # Acknowledgements The project ”Anpassung eines BHKWs durch additive gefertigte Komponenten für Wasserstoff” was funded by the NBank Wasserstoffrichtlinie - Project number ZW1 80162254. We would like to thank our project partner A-TRON Blockheizkraftwerke GmbH for providing a CHP system and individual components.".
<http://localhost:5002/43e9710b-b902-418a-8d0b-13666c2f3c0d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "43e9710b-b902-418a-8d0b-13666c2f3c0d".
