<http://localhost:5002/afc1117d-28a4-48cf-bd30-979da79ab63e> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Data for \\'Saltation-Induced Dust Emission of Dust Devils in the Convective Boundary Layer\\'".
<http://localhost:5002/afc1117d-28a4-48cf-bd30-979da79ab63e> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This data (.zip file) contain all relevant model steering, output, plot, and analysis files that were used to create the publication \\'Saltation-Induced Dust Emission of Dust Devils in the Convective Boundary Layer - An LES Study on the Meter Scale\\' in the Journal of Geophysical Research: Atmospheres.".
