<http://localhost:5002/5881db53-b314-445d-aac0-b5c74d886888> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>.
<http://localhost:5002/5881db53-b314-445d-aac0-b5c74d886888> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2F87u6cf1r>.
<http://localhost:5002/5881db53-b314-445d-aac0-b5c74d886888> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Application Example for Feature Recognition".
<http://localhost:5002/5881db53-b314-445d-aac0-b5c74d886888> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This data involves a CAD-file (ipt and stp) of a shaft which is used as an application example for feature recognition. Additionally an annotated picture of that model is added, which shows all features on the shaft. An Excel-file is used to visualize the information, that was extracted by the feature recognition-script from the CAD-model (ipt).".
