<http://localhost:5002/f3648ea7-ad20-4bd8-bf90-59fea289dcfb> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2F6cyjv3yq>.
<http://localhost:5002/f3648ea7-ad20-4bd8-bf90-59fea289dcfb> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "4½-stage high-speed axial compressor open test case of the Institute of Turbomachinery and Fluid Dynamics at Leibniz University Hannover".
<http://localhost:5002/f3648ea7-ad20-4bd8-bf90-59fea289dcfb> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "TFD-4AC: 4½-stage high-speed axial compressor open test case of the Institute of Turbomachinery and Fluid Dynamics at Leibniz University Hannover, Germany  Geometry and performance data published at the TFD-4AC workshop at at the 16th European Turbomachinery Conference (ETC16) Turbomachinery, Fluid Dynamics and Thermodynamics, March 24-28, 2025; Hannover, Germany.  Inter-row traverse data published at the 5th GPPS Turbomachinery CFD Workshop of the Global Power and Propulsion Society technical conference 2025 (GPPS Shanghai25), September 4-6; Shanghai, China.".
