<http://localhost:5002/02f1fc3f-f9fd-486d-b730-f7304f6d69f3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This data-set contains the hydroGNSS displacement time series generated by combining GNSS vertical displacements from IGS or NGL and a hydrological product. It was generated for 143 GNSS stations over Europe. We also include the .m file necessary to generate the time series.".
