<http://localhost:5002/77718c5e-e729-4443-aa15-72ca00dc495f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>.
<http://localhost:5002/77718c5e-e729-4443-aa15-72ca00dc495f> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2Ftvlce5gz>.
<http://localhost:5002/77718c5e-e729-4443-aa15-72ca00dc495f> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "CoSense3D".
<http://localhost:5002/77718c5e-e729-4443-aa15-72ca00dc495f> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This Repo provides all datasets or their external links for the project CoSense3D. The related datasets are:  -  [__COMAP__](https://data.uni-hannover.de/vault/ikg/yuan/cosense3d/COMAP/): A synthetic data generated by CARLA for cooperative perception.  -  [__OPV2Vt__](https://data.uni-hannover.de/vault/ikg/yuan/cosense3d/OPV2Vt/): A synthetic data generated by CARLA with the replay files provided by the dataset [OPV2V](https://mobility-lab.seas.ucla.edu/opv2v/) for the purpose of globally time-aligned cooperative object detection (TA-COOD). The original replay files are interpolated to obtain the object and sensor locations at sub-frames. Each frame is spitted into 10 sub-frames for simulation.   -  [__DairV2Xt__](https://data.uni-hannover.de/vault/ikg/yuan/cosense3d/DairV2Xt/): New generate meta files based on dataset [DAIR-V2X](https://thudair.baai.ac.cn/index) for the project CoSense3D with localization correction and ground truth generate for TA-COOD.  -  [__OPV2Va__](https://data.uni-hannover.de/vault/ikg/yuan/cosense3d/OPV2Va/): A synthetic data generated by CARLA with the replay files provided by the dataset [OPV2V](https://mobility-lab.seas.ucla.edu/opv2v/) augmented with semantic labels.  > [__!NOTE__] > If you find the downloading speed is very slow, you can also try the Baidu Cloud: 链接: https://pan.baidu.com/s/12HZ1yk0y84NJfStZADMstA?pwd=hkja 提取码: hkja  --来自百度网盘超级会员v1的分享".
