<http://localhost:5002/ef8fec03-c341-4d9a-bd6f-cb0c00e03770> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Visual Inspection Ontology".
<http://localhost:5002/ef8fec03-c341-4d9a-bd6f-cb0c00e03770> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This file contains all relevant files of the developed visual inspection ontology for documenting visual inspections. The ontology is embedded and implemented in the semantics MediaWiki of the SFB. It contains all relevant object and data properties and classes for semantically linking the content to be documented. Furthermore, the file is published and accessible via GitHub".
