<http://localhost:5002/d996e19c-2498-4d98-b47b-3d20dd6b14bd> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T09:54:57.292164"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/d996e19c-2498-4d98-b47b-3d20dd6b14bd> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> <http://localhost:5002/organization/institut-fur-dynamik-und-schwingungen>.
<http://localhost:5002/d996e19c-2498-4d98-b47b-3d20dd6b14bd> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double>.
