<http://localhost:5002/d6fd573f-162f-49c1-a4be-a0c2f9df3d3a> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Trajectories in a shared space".
<http://localhost:5002/d6fd573f-162f-49c1-a4be-a0c2f9df3d3a> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "## The data contains trajectories and basic information about road users in a shared space.   ### Trajectories are denoted with time step, object id, x-coordinate, y-coordinate, and user type. Each time step last 0.5 seconds. Coordinates are in pixel and can be transferred to real-world scale using the scale provided. There are three types of users: pedestrian, cyclist, and vehicle.  ### In addition, the data also provides demographic attributes for road users. Pedestrians walking in groups are annotated.".
