<http://localhost:5002/549917f2-0429-40e2-8851-0fe49d53fde6> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Set-up and source code for the paper \\'Modeling of land-surface interactions in the PALM model system 6.0: Land surface model description, first evaluation, and sensitivity to model parameters\\', submitted to Geoscientific Model Development  Note that cases ALBE_24 and ALBE_04 in Table 5 of the revised paper are called LSM_vali_s_ALBE_44 and LSM_vali_s_ALBE_24 in the dataset, respectively.".
