<http://localhost:5002/ca5153a0-7d76-42d8-b094-1e4aad1b8cf5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2Fhbni054l>.
<http://localhost:5002/ca5153a0-7d76-42d8-b094-1e4aad1b8cf5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Higher-order mean-field theory of chiral waveguide QED".
<http://localhost:5002/ca5153a0-7d76-42d8-b094-1e4aad1b8cf5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "__Python algorithm of: Higher-order mean-field theory of chiral waveguide QED__  This dataset contains the Python code to reproduce the results in the manuscript https://scipost.org/SciPostPhysCore.6.2.041 and can be used to explore parameter regimes not treted there".
