<http://localhost:5002/ca5153a0-7d76-42d8-b094-1e4aad1b8cf5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-08-12T10:02:43.040089"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
