<http://localhost:5002/d7613f7e-7c11-4ba7-99a0-6d6114d9f4d2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/temporal> _:d7613f7e-7c11-4ba7-99a0-6d6114d9f4d2.
<http://localhost:5002/01325da6-f100-48bd-b366-7e6a89634971> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset>.
<http://localhost:5002/01325da6-f100-48bd-b366-7e6a89634971> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.25835%2F43s2n8pq>.
<http://localhost:5002/01325da6-f100-48bd-b366-7e6a89634971> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "A Novel Way to Reduce the Critical Deformation for Cold Roll Bonding".
<http://localhost:5002/01325da6-f100-48bd-b366-7e6a89634971> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This set provides supplementary data for the following paper: Barienti, K.; Werwein, S.; Herbst, S.; Maier, H.J.; Nürnberger, F. A Novel Way to Reduce the Critical Deformation for Cold Roll Bonding. _Manufacturing Letters_ **2023**, _36_, 9–12, doi:[10.1016/j.mfglet.2022.12.006](https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mfglet.2022.12.006).  The dataset includes: - the raw data for the $$O_2$$ concentration while filling the glovebox (./O2_glovebox) - .csv files of the image correlation for particle size measurements (./particle_size) - the qualitative bonding information used for sigmoid fitting (./recuction_bonded)   Acknowledgements This research was funded by the Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft (DFG, German Research Foundation)—Project-ID 394563137—SFB 1368.  --- keywords: [Cold Roll Bonding, Rolling, Copper, Aluminum, XHV, Silane] created: 2023-01-20 authors: [Barienti, K.; Werwein, S.; Herbst, S.; Maier, H.J.; Nürnberger, F.] related_doi: 10.1016/j.mfglet.2022.12.006 Acknowledgement: DFG Project-ID 394563137—SFB 1368. ---".
