<http://localhost:5002/18a745b4-3000-4956-80a3-8d04407f9114> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Aerial drone (DJI Phantom 3 Quadcopter UAV) footage during flood tide showing turbidity patterns (TP1-5) in the Harle tidal inlet in the vicinity of the submerged groyne. The imagery provides, inter alia, a top-down view of the turbidity patterns at the flow around the groyne tip and in the groyne wake. The turbidity patterns are described in Herbst et al. (2026) (https://doi.org/10.1016/j.csr.2026.105718).".
