<http://localhost:5002/e79e01f5-5fba-4bfb-a2a2-a33985fe6671> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The repository\\'s content documents the conception of structured description templates and structured evaluation questionnaires for educational images, with the objective to improve accessibility for blind and visually impaired users.   Included:  **Description_Criteria_with_ Interview_Excerpts.pdf** -- Derived core criteria for efficient descriptions, and excerpts from the performed expert interviews that led to their formulation.  **Templates for Image Descriptions.pdf** -- Structured image description templates  **Questionnaire Questions.pdf** -- Structured evaluation questionnaire **Image Description Overview.pdf** -- Entry document with links to (a) used example images, (b) description derived based on structured templates, (c) control description from formal description templates from an expert institution **Template-based Image Descriptions** -- Folder containing sample images and corresponding descriptions, (a) using our template-based description approach, (b) control description from formal description templates from an expert institution".
