<http://localhost:5002/5c26b97b-0add-4bde-94e4-2f8f48c83286> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots (in fbbbf grading) and finite size spectral data for some low energy states in the sector (p;q)=(1;1/2) of the quantum group invariant U_q[OSp(3|2)] quantum chain with even length and gamma=2pi/9. As an example of the finite size  data for \\gamma>pi/2  this dataset also includes the ground state for gamma=4pi/7.  Note that the Bethe roots are rescaled by a factor gamma as compared to the notation in the paper.".
