<http://localhost:5002/3826d8d9-5af0-45b3-bee0-6a554c89f16a> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots (in  fbbbf grading) and finite size spectral data for some low energy states in the sector (p;q)=(2;1/2) of the quantum group invariant U_q[OSp(3|2)] quantum chain with odd length and gamma=2pi/9.  Note that the Bethe roots are rescaled by a factor gamma as compared to the notation in the paper.".
