<http://localhost:5002/7bc91e6f-c692-47da-b689-f748c94b875d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots for a state of the even length D^{(2)}_3 spin chain with boundary conditions (epsilon=0,p=0) in the sector (h_1,h_2)=(1,1).  * the root configuration consists of complex conjugate pairs with imag. part (\\pi/2-\\gamma) on level one, pi/2 on level two. In addition, we have one real level-1 root.  * the subleading corrections to scaling are power laws".
