<http://localhost:5002/82a9abc7-49fb-4c66-9f29-159f845050ed> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
