<http://localhost:5002/82a9abc7-49fb-4c66-9f29-159f845050ed> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots for a state of the even length D^{(2)}_3 spin chain with boundary conditions (epsilon=0,p=0) in the sector (h_1,h_2)=(2,2).  * the root configuration consists of complex conjugate pairs with imag. part (\\pi/2-\\gamma) on level one, pi/2 on level two. In addition, we have one level-1 root with an imaginary part pi/2 and one real level-1 root. * the subleading corrections to scaling are power laws".
