<http://localhost:5002/613820dc-0952-4ac9-9db0-ebaa669f69c7> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots for a state of the odd length D^{(2)}_3 spin chain with boundary conditions (epsilon=0,p=0) in the sector (h_1,h_2)=(3,0).  * the root configuration consists of complex conjugate pairs with imag. part (\\pi/2-\\gamma) on level one, pi/2 on level two * this state is the lowest state in this sector * the subleading corrections to scaling are power laws".
