<http://localhost:5002/dd5c744e-3de2-44aa-ba56-65362e7d0241> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/dd5c744e-3de2-44aa-ba56-65362e7d0241> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/dd5c744e-3de2-44aa-ba56-65362e7d0241> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots for a state of the even length D^{(2)}_3 spin chain with boundary conditions (epsilon=1,p=0) in the sector (h^l,h^r)=(0,0).  * the root configuration consists of complex conjugate pairs with imag. part (\\pi/2-\\gamma) on level one, pi/2 on level two * this state is a discrete state below a continuum of states in this sector in the thermodynamic limit * the subleading corrections to scaling are power laws".
<http://localhost:5002/dd5c744e-3de2-44aa-ba56-65362e7d0241> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize> "382668"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>.
