<http://localhost:5002/d50621a3-c563-4ad7-a77c-1d54cc722a8b> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T09:49:41.290149"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/4d6b9696-09a0-488b-9dcd-d0207db191f3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Distribution>.
<http://localhost:5002/4d6b9696-09a0-488b-9dcd-d0207db191f3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "BC (1,0): class A-state #3 in sector (0,0)".
<http://localhost:5002/4d6b9696-09a0-488b-9dcd-d0207db191f3> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/4d6b9696-09a0-488b-9dcd-d0207db191f3> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/4d6b9696-09a0-488b-9dcd-d0207db191f3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots for a state of the even length D^{(2)}_3 spin chain with boundary conditions (epsilon=1,p=0) in the sector (h_1,h_2)=(0,0).  * the root configuration consists of complex conjugate pairs with imag. part (\\pi/2-\\gamma) on level one, pi/2 on level two and one additional real root on each level, one additional level-1 root on the line with imag part pi/2 and one additional level-2 root on the line pi.  * this state is a continuum state. * the subleading corrections to scaling are logarithmic".
<http://localhost:5002/4d6b9696-09a0-488b-9dcd-d0207db191f3> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize> "190535"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>.
