<http://localhost:5002/4d6b9696-09a0-488b-9dcd-d0207db191f3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2025-08-18T13:41:44.297861"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/4d6b9696-09a0-488b-9dcd-d0207db191f3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T09:49:41.290355"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/2b98c116-48a1-4a59-878c-e15e405287f0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Distribution>.
<http://localhost:5002/2b98c116-48a1-4a59-878c-e15e405287f0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "BC (1,0): class A-state #1 in sector (1,0)".
<http://localhost:5002/2b98c116-48a1-4a59-878c-e15e405287f0> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/2b98c116-48a1-4a59-878c-e15e405287f0> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/2b98c116-48a1-4a59-878c-e15e405287f0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots for a state of the odd length D^{(2)}_3 spin chain with boundary conditions (epsilon=1,p=0) in the sector (h_1,h_2)=(1,0).  * the root configuration consists of complex conjugate pairs with imag. part (\\pi/2-\\gamma) on level one, pi/2 on level two      pi/6<gamma<pi/4:  * this state is the ground state of the spin chain for large enough N and the lowest from a continuum of states in this sector in the thermodynamic limit * the subleading corrections to scaling are logarithmic  gamma<pi/6:   * this state becomes a discrete state below the continuum of states  * the subleading corrections to scaling are power laws".
<http://localhost:5002/2b98c116-48a1-4a59-878c-e15e405287f0> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize> "210369"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>.
<http://localhost:5002/2b98c116-48a1-4a59-878c-e15e405287f0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/format> "ZIP".
<http://localhost:5002/2b98c116-48a1-4a59-878c-e15e405287f0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2025-08-15T14:30:23.115701"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/2b98c116-48a1-4a59-878c-e15e405287f0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T09:49:41.290551"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/dfc31591-81ca-4b4d-be1d-4060845d8521> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Distribution>.
<http://localhost:5002/dfc31591-81ca-4b4d-be1d-4060845d8521> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "BC (1,0): class A-state #2 in sector (1,0)".
<http://localhost:5002/dfc31591-81ca-4b4d-be1d-4060845d8521> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/dfc31591-81ca-4b4d-be1d-4060845d8521> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/dfc31591-81ca-4b4d-be1d-4060845d8521> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots for a state of the even length D^{(2)}_3 spin chain with boundary conditions (epsilon=1,p=0) in the sector (h_1,h_2)=(1,0).  * the root configuration consists of complex conjugate pairs with imag. part (\\pi/2-\\gamma) on level one, pi/2 on level two. In addition we have one root on level-1 on the line i pi/2 and one level-2 root at zero. * this state is first excited state from a continuum of states in this sector in the thermodynamic limit * the subleading corrections to scaling are logarithmic".
<http://localhost:5002/dfc31591-81ca-4b4d-be1d-4060845d8521> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize> "101413"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>.
