<http://localhost:5002/d08b7c38-9e7c-4fc7-929e-71d552d79e91> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "BC (1,0): class A-state #3 in sector (1,0)".
<http://localhost:5002/d08b7c38-9e7c-4fc7-929e-71d552d79e91> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
