<http://localhost:5002/4981a059-8796-428a-bc56-4be9297917be> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "BC (1,0): class A-state #4 in sector (1,0)".
<http://localhost:5002/4981a059-8796-428a-bc56-4be9297917be> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
