<http://localhost:5002/32970e85-8c15-4e0e-b364-eabbb30e9bc2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "BC (1,0): class A-state #1 in sector (1,1)".
<http://localhost:5002/32970e85-8c15-4e0e-b364-eabbb30e9bc2> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
