<http://localhost:5002/fb0af5c4-5300-4e0e-8dfa-ee3190a35a31> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "BC (1,0): class A-state #1 in sector (2,1)".
<http://localhost:5002/fb0af5c4-5300-4e0e-8dfa-ee3190a35a31> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
