<http://localhost:5002/2a91b074-bd0a-497c-98e3-2086ef3ffafd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Distribution>.
<http://localhost:5002/2a91b074-bd0a-497c-98e3-2086ef3ffafd> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "BC (1,0): class A-state #1 in sector (2,2)".
<http://localhost:5002/2a91b074-bd0a-497c-98e3-2086ef3ffafd> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/2a91b074-bd0a-497c-98e3-2086ef3ffafd> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/2a91b074-bd0a-497c-98e3-2086ef3ffafd> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots for a state of the even length D^{(2)}_3 spin chain with boundary conditions (epsilon=1,p=0) in the sector (h_1,h_2)=(2,2).  * the root configuration consists of complex conjugate pairs with imag. part (\\pi/2-\\gamma) on level one, pi/2 on level two, we have two additional level-1 roots whose imaginary part is either 0 or pi/2. * this state is the lowest continuum state in this sector in the thermodynamic limit * the subleading corrections to scaling are logarithmic".
<http://localhost:5002/2a91b074-bd0a-497c-98e3-2086ef3ffafd> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize> "137620"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>.
<http://localhost:5002/2a91b074-bd0a-497c-98e3-2086ef3ffafd> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/format> "ZIP".
<http://localhost:5002/2a91b074-bd0a-497c-98e3-2086ef3ffafd> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2025-08-16T16:26:17.609850"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/2a91b074-bd0a-497c-98e3-2086ef3ffafd> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T09:49:41.291381"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/01571c84-b816-4711-9169-59bcdfa39587> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Distribution>.
<http://localhost:5002/01571c84-b816-4711-9169-59bcdfa39587> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "BC (1,0): class A-state #1 in sector (3,0)".
<http://localhost:5002/01571c84-b816-4711-9169-59bcdfa39587> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/01571c84-b816-4711-9169-59bcdfa39587> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/01571c84-b816-4711-9169-59bcdfa39587> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots for a state of the odd length D^{(2)}_3 spin chain with boundary conditions (epsilon=1,p=0) in the sector (h_1,h_2)=(3,0).  pi/10<\\gamma<pi/4:   * the root configuration consists of complex conjugate pairs with imag. part (\\pi/2-\\gamma) on level one, pi/2 on level two * this state is the lowest continuum state in this sector in the thermodynamic limit, it is the ground state for pi/10<gamma<\\pi/8 * the subleading corrections to scaling are logarithmic  \\gamma<\\pi/10:  * the state is discrete.  * the corrections to scaling are power law".
<http://localhost:5002/01571c84-b816-4711-9169-59bcdfa39587> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize> "415435"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>.
<http://localhost:5002/01571c84-b816-4711-9169-59bcdfa39587> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/format> "ZIP".
<http://localhost:5002/01571c84-b816-4711-9169-59bcdfa39587> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2025-08-16T12:58:44.357320"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/01571c84-b816-4711-9169-59bcdfa39587> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T09:49:41.291493"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/35ada1d6-f970-4ffa-a560-5da342fef156> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Distribution>.
<http://localhost:5002/35ada1d6-f970-4ffa-a560-5da342fef156> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "BC (1,0): class B-state #1 in sector (1,0)".
<http://localhost:5002/35ada1d6-f970-4ffa-a560-5da342fef156> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/35ada1d6-f970-4ffa-a560-5da342fef156> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/35ada1d6-f970-4ffa-a560-5da342fef156> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots for a state of the even length D^{(2)}_3 spin chain with boundary conditions (epsilon=1,p=0) in the sector (h_1,h_2)=(1,0).  * the root configuration consists of complex conjugate pairs with imag. part (\\pi/2-\\gamma) on level one, pi/2 on level two, we have one additional real level-1 roots and one additional real level-2 root. * this state is discrete but yet does not fit in the classification * the subleading corrections to scaling are powerlaw".
<http://localhost:5002/35ada1d6-f970-4ffa-a560-5da342fef156> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize> "379824"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>.
<http://localhost:5002/35ada1d6-f970-4ffa-a560-5da342fef156> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/format> "ZIP".
<http://localhost:5002/35ada1d6-f970-4ffa-a560-5da342fef156> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2025-08-16T16:02:51.552512"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/35ada1d6-f970-4ffa-a560-5da342fef156> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T09:49:41.291599"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/905b0f29-a07c-4397-bc6b-5042d28e4d9d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Distribution>.
<http://localhost:5002/905b0f29-a07c-4397-bc6b-5042d28e4d9d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "BC (1,1): class A-state #1 in sector (0,1)".
<http://localhost:5002/905b0f29-a07c-4397-bc6b-5042d28e4d9d> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/905b0f29-a07c-4397-bc6b-5042d28e4d9d> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/905b0f29-a07c-4397-bc6b-5042d28e4d9d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots for a state of the odd length D^{(2)}_3 spin chain with boundary conditions (epsilon=1,p=1) in the sector (h^l,h^r)=(0,1).  The degeneracy of this state is g=6 as expected for this sector.  * the root configuration consists of complex conjugate pairs with imag. part (\\pi/2-\\gamma) on level one, pi/2 on level two * this state is a discrete state below a continuum of states in this sector in the thermodynamic limit * the subleading corrections to scaling are power laws".
<http://localhost:5002/905b0f29-a07c-4397-bc6b-5042d28e4d9d> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize> "360794"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>.
<http://localhost:5002/905b0f29-a07c-4397-bc6b-5042d28e4d9d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/format> "ZIP".
<http://localhost:5002/905b0f29-a07c-4397-bc6b-5042d28e4d9d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2025-07-29T13:39:02.127725"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/905b0f29-a07c-4397-bc6b-5042d28e4d9d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T09:49:41.291705"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/4d454dcf-e257-488a-9bfc-0497194ff0d0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Distribution>.
<http://localhost:5002/4d454dcf-e257-488a-9bfc-0497194ff0d0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "BC (1,1): class A-state #2 in sector (0,1)".
<http://localhost:5002/4d454dcf-e257-488a-9bfc-0497194ff0d0> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/4d454dcf-e257-488a-9bfc-0497194ff0d0> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/4d454dcf-e257-488a-9bfc-0497194ff0d0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots for a state of the even length D^{(2)}_3 spin chain with boundary conditions (epsilon=1,p=1) in the sector (h^l,h^r)=(0,1).  The degeneracy of this state is g=6 as expected for this sector.  * the root configuration consists of complex conjugate pairs with imag. part (\\pi/2-\\gamma) plus a single real root on level one; complex conjugate pairs with imag. part pi/2 plus a single root 0 on level two * this state is a discrete state below a continuum of states in this sector in the thermodynamic limit * the subleading corrections to scaling are power laws".
<http://localhost:5002/4d454dcf-e257-488a-9bfc-0497194ff0d0> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize> "40658"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>.
<http://localhost:5002/4d454dcf-e257-488a-9bfc-0497194ff0d0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/format> "ZIP".
<http://localhost:5002/4d454dcf-e257-488a-9bfc-0497194ff0d0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2025-08-25T11:41:09.241402"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/4d454dcf-e257-488a-9bfc-0497194ff0d0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T09:49:41.291812"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/04953d74-ebd4-4a8e-8e3a-601b460c935d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Distribution>.
<http://localhost:5002/04953d74-ebd4-4a8e-8e3a-601b460c935d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "BC (1,1): class A-state #3 in sector (0,1)".
<http://localhost:5002/04953d74-ebd4-4a8e-8e3a-601b460c935d> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/04953d74-ebd4-4a8e-8e3a-601b460c935d> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/04953d74-ebd4-4a8e-8e3a-601b460c935d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots for a state of the odd length D^{(2)}_3 spin chain with boundary conditions (epsilon=1,p=1) in the sector (h_1,h_2)=(0,1) for gamma>pi/6.  The degeneracy of this state is g=6 as expected for this sector.  * this state is the lowest state from a continuum of states in this sector in the thermodynamic limit (expected to turn into a discrete one below gamma=pi/6) * the subleading corrections to scaling are logarithmic   ####pi/5<gamma<pi/4:  * the root configuration consists of complex conjugate pairs with imag. part (\\pi/2-\\gamma) plus one root with imag. part pi/2 and one real root on level one; complex conjugate pairs with imag. part pi/2 on level two plus a pair of roots with imag. parts 0 and pi  ####pi/6<gamma<pi/5: * the root configuration consists of complex conjugate pairs with imag. part (\\pi/2-\\gamma) plus one root with imag. part pi/2 and one real root on level one; complex conjugate pairs with imag. part pi/2 on level two plus a pair of roots with imag. parts +/- pi/2".
<http://localhost:5002/04953d74-ebd4-4a8e-8e3a-601b460c935d> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize> "255537"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>.
<http://localhost:5002/04953d74-ebd4-4a8e-8e3a-601b460c935d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/format> "ZIP".
<http://localhost:5002/04953d74-ebd4-4a8e-8e3a-601b460c935d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2025-08-25T11:56:53.570502"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/04953d74-ebd4-4a8e-8e3a-601b460c935d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T09:49:41.291919"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/194437cc-a887-4552-b8fa-47afbf9db9ce> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Distribution>.
<http://localhost:5002/194437cc-a887-4552-b8fa-47afbf9db9ce> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "BC (1,1): class A-state #4 in sector (0,1)".
<http://localhost:5002/194437cc-a887-4552-b8fa-47afbf9db9ce> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/194437cc-a887-4552-b8fa-47afbf9db9ce> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/194437cc-a887-4552-b8fa-47afbf9db9ce> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots for a state of the odd length D^{(2)}_3 spin chain with boundary conditions (epsilon=1,p=1) in the sector (h_1,h_2)=(0,1).  The degeneracy of this state is g=6 as expected for this sector.   ####pi/6<gamma<pi/4: * this state is part of a continuum of states in this sector in the thermodynamic limit * the subleading corrections to scaling are logarithmic  ####gamma<pi/6: * this state is a discrete state below a continuum of states in this sector in the thermodynamic limit * the subleading corrections to scaling are power laws".
<http://localhost:5002/194437cc-a887-4552-b8fa-47afbf9db9ce> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize> "135198"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>.
