<http://localhost:5002/194437cc-a887-4552-b8fa-47afbf9db9ce> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T09:49:41.292027"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/e8266014-57d4-48f3-82ff-c2a37b937327> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Distribution>.
<http://localhost:5002/e8266014-57d4-48f3-82ff-c2a37b937327> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "BC (1,1): class A-state #1 in sector (0,2)".
<http://localhost:5002/e8266014-57d4-48f3-82ff-c2a37b937327> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/e8266014-57d4-48f3-82ff-c2a37b937327> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/e8266014-57d4-48f3-82ff-c2a37b937327> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots for a state of the even length D^{(2)}_3 spin chain with boundary conditions (epsilon=1,p=1) in the sector (h^l,h^r)=(0,2).  * the root configuration consists of complex conjugate pairs with imag. part (\\pi/2-\\gamma) on level one, pi/2 on level two  * the degeneracy of this state is g=10 as expected for this sector ####pi/6<gamma<pi/4:  * this state is the ground state of the spin chain and the lowest from a continuum of states in this sector in the thermodynamic limit * the subleading corrections to scaling are logarithmic ####gamma<pi/6: * this state becomes a _discrete_ state below the continuum of states * the subleading corrections to scaling are power laws".
<http://localhost:5002/e8266014-57d4-48f3-82ff-c2a37b937327> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize> "1443103"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>.
