<http://localhost:5002/e8266014-57d4-48f3-82ff-c2a37b937327> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2025-07-29T09:38:05.300279"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/e8266014-57d4-48f3-82ff-c2a37b937327> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T09:49:41.292135"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/cb51b136-8d8b-4a41-a18d-632727cc27b6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Distribution>.
<http://localhost:5002/cb51b136-8d8b-4a41-a18d-632727cc27b6> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "BC (1,1): class A-state #2 in sector (0,2)".
<http://localhost:5002/cb51b136-8d8b-4a41-a18d-632727cc27b6> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/cb51b136-8d8b-4a41-a18d-632727cc27b6> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/cb51b136-8d8b-4a41-a18d-632727cc27b6> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots for a state of the odd length D^{(2)}_3 spin chain with boundary conditions (epsilon=1,p=1) in the sector (h^l,h^r)=(0,2).   * the degeneracy of this state is g=10 as expected for this sector ####pi/6<gamma<pi/4:  * the root configuration consists of complex conjugate pairs with imag. part (pi/2-gamma) plus a single root with imag. part pi/2 on level one; complex conjugate paris  with imag. part pi/2 plus a single root 0 on level two * this state is the first excitation in a continuum of states in this sector in the thermodynamic limit * the subleading corrections to scaling are logarithmic ####gamma<pi/6: * the root configuration consists of complex conjugate pairs with imag. part (pi/2-gamma) plus a single root with imag. part pi/2 on level one; complex conjugate paris  with imag. part pi/2 plus a single root i.pi on level two * this state becomes a _discrete_ state below the continuum of states with the same conformal weight as the class A-state #1 in this sector * the subleading corrections to scaling are power laws".
<http://localhost:5002/cb51b136-8d8b-4a41-a18d-632727cc27b6> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize> "525713"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>.
