<http://localhost:5002/28b20367-3f98-4e96-b982-e738fd215d98> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots for a state of the even length D^{(2)}_3 spin chain with boundary conditions (epsilon=1,p=1) in the sector (h^l,h^r)=(0,2).   * the degeneracy of this state is g=10 as expected for this sector ####pi/8<gamma<pi/4:  * this state is the second excitation in a continuum of states in this sector in the thermodynamic limit * the subleading corrections to scaling are logarithmic ####gamma<pi/8: * this state becomes another _discrete_ state below the continuum of states * the subleading corrections to scaling are power laws".
<http://localhost:5002/28b20367-3f98-4e96-b982-e738fd215d98> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize> "87079"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>.
