<http://localhost:5002/871e29a4-01b3-48ea-968e-bfaed9d74312> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "BC (1,1): class A-state #4 in sector (0,2)".
<http://localhost:5002/871e29a4-01b3-48ea-968e-bfaed9d74312> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
