<http://localhost:5002/871e29a4-01b3-48ea-968e-bfaed9d74312> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots for a state of the odd length D^{(2)}_3 spin chain with boundary conditions (epsilon=1,p=1) in the sector (h^l,h^r)=(0,2).   * the degeneracy of this state is g=10 as expected for this sector ####gamma=pi/5:  * this state is the third excitation in a continuum of states in this sector in the thermodynamic limit * the subleading corrections to scaling are logarithmic".
<http://localhost:5002/871e29a4-01b3-48ea-968e-bfaed9d74312> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize> "6038"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>.
