<http://localhost:5002/871e29a4-01b3-48ea-968e-bfaed9d74312> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T09:49:41.292475"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/ea8d04b9-f279-4360-933f-c026be83df62> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Distribution>.
<http://localhost:5002/ea8d04b9-f279-4360-933f-c026be83df62> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "BC (1,1): class A-state #1 in sector (0,3)".
<http://localhost:5002/ea8d04b9-f279-4360-933f-c026be83df62> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/ea8d04b9-f279-4360-933f-c026be83df62> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/ea8d04b9-f279-4360-933f-c026be83df62> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots for the ground state of the odd length D^{(2)}_3 spin chain with boundary conditions (epsilon=1,p=1) in the sector (h^l,h^r)=(0,3).  * the root configuration consists of complex conjugate pairs with imag. part (\\pi/2-\\gamma) on level one, pi/2 on level two  * the degeneracy of this state is g=14. ####pi6<gamma<pi/4:  * this state is the the lowest from a continuum of states in this sector in the thermodynamic limit * the subleading corrections to scaling are logarithmic ####pi/8<gamma<pi/6:  * this state is the ground state of the spin chain and the lowest from a continuum of states in this sector in the thermodynamic limit * the subleading corrections to scaling are logarithmic ####gamma<pi/8: * this state becomes a _discrete_ state below the continuum of states * the subleading corrections to scaling are power laws".
<http://localhost:5002/ea8d04b9-f279-4360-933f-c026be83df62> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize> "1553974"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>.
<http://localhost:5002/ea8d04b9-f279-4360-933f-c026be83df62> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/format> "ZIP".
<http://localhost:5002/ea8d04b9-f279-4360-933f-c026be83df62> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2025-08-07T14:31:57.095092"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/ea8d04b9-f279-4360-933f-c026be83df62> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T09:49:41.292586"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/de9a0d51-d587-4b8a-b965-a5dffd2ec20e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Distribution>.
<http://localhost:5002/de9a0d51-d587-4b8a-b965-a5dffd2ec20e> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "BC (1,1): class A-state #2 in sector (0,3)".
<http://localhost:5002/de9a0d51-d587-4b8a-b965-a5dffd2ec20e> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/de9a0d51-d587-4b8a-b965-a5dffd2ec20e> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/de9a0d51-d587-4b8a-b965-a5dffd2ec20e> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots for a state of the even length D^{(2)}_3 spin chain with boundary conditions (epsilon=1,p=1) in the sector (h^l,h^r)=(0,3) for gamma=pi/5.  * The degeneracy of this state is g=14 as expected for this sector. * The root configuration at gamma=pi/5 consists of       \\- level-1: (N-4)/2 complex conjugate pairs with imag. part (pi/2-gamma) plus a single root with imag. part pi/2       \\- level-2: (N-4)/2 complex conjugate paris  with imag. part pi/2 plus a single root 0 * This state is the first excitation in a continuum of states in this sector in the thermodynamic limit. * The subleading corrections to scaling are logarithmic.".
<http://localhost:5002/de9a0d51-d587-4b8a-b965-a5dffd2ec20e> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize> "1453"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>.
