<http://localhost:5002/ebb7ee06-1037-4e79-ba6a-df003a9dba3d> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots for a state of the even length D^{(2)}_3 spin chain with boundary conditions (epsilon=1,p=1) in the sector (h^l,h^r)=(1,1).   * the degeneracy of this state is g=18, twice as what is expected from the Uq(B1)xUq(B1) plus self-duality symmetries for this sector. * this is a discrete state below a continuum.".
