<http://localhost:5002/fdd5828a-aa54-46ef-b866-de88104306cd> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/fdd5828a-aa54-46ef-b866-de88104306cd> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots for a state of the even length D^{(2)}_3 spin chain with boundary conditions (epsilon=1,p=1) in the sector (h^l,h^r)=(1,1).   * degeneracy of this state is g=18, twice what one expects for this sector  * corrections to scaling are power laws  ####0.14 pi<=gamma<pi/4:  * the root configuration contains one singular root i.gamma on the first level in addition to the usual strings.  ####gamma<=0.13 pi: * one of the level-1 2-strings and then one of the level-2 ones are replaced by different configurations.".
