<http://localhost:5002/7308a4f5-2fed-4e22-9d80-c2615e168888> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots for a state of the even length D^{(2)}_3 spin chain with boundary conditions (epsilon=1,p=1) in the sector (h^l,h^r)=(0,1).  * degeneracy of this state is g=18, twice what one expects for this sector * the root configuration contains one singular root i.gamma on the first level and one singular string (-2i.gamma,0,2i.gamma) on the second level * corrections to scaling are power laws * the conformal weight is shifted by 1/2 compared to state #1 in this sector".
