<http://localhost:5002/e6b714f7-6c0a-4075-81da-8e05a2a5dcb2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots for a state of the even length D^{(2)}_3 spin chain with boundary conditions (epsilon=1,p=1) in the sector (h^l,h^r)=(0,0).  * degeneracy of this state is g=2, twice what one expects for this sector * the root configuration contains two singular roots i.gamma on the first level * corrections to scaling are power laws * the effective conformal weight is (-1/6) + gamma/(2.pi)".
