<http://localhost:5002/6edaf545-de8d-4d68-8c2b-837146c17806> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/6edaf545-de8d-4d68-8c2b-837146c17806> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots for a state of the odd length D^{(2)}_3 spin chain with boundary conditions (epsilon=1,p=1) in the sector (h^l,h^r)=(0,1).   * degeneracy of this state is g=12, twice what one expects for this sector after taking into account self-duality * the root configuration contains two singular roots i.gamma on the first level  * corrections to scaling are power laws  * the effective conformal weight is (-1/6) + 5.gamma/(2.pi)".
<http://localhost:5002/6edaf545-de8d-4d68-8c2b-837146c17806> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize> "30524"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>.
<http://localhost:5002/6edaf545-de8d-4d68-8c2b-837146c17806> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/format> "ZIP".
<http://localhost:5002/6edaf545-de8d-4d68-8c2b-837146c17806> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2025-07-25T10:12:02.574502"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/6edaf545-de8d-4d68-8c2b-837146c17806> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T09:49:41.294593"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/f03631a7-89f1-4116-9674-9bbb10f1ea92> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Distribution>.
<http://localhost:5002/f03631a7-89f1-4116-9674-9bbb10f1ea92> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "BC (1,1): class C-state #2 in sector (0,1)".
<http://localhost:5002/f03631a7-89f1-4116-9674-9bbb10f1ea92> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/f03631a7-89f1-4116-9674-9bbb10f1ea92> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
<http://localhost:5002/f03631a7-89f1-4116-9674-9bbb10f1ea92> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots for a state of the even length D^{(2)}_3 spin chain with boundary conditions (epsilon=1,p=1) in the sector (h^l,h^r)=(0,1).  * degeneracy of this state is g=12, twice what one expects for this sector after taking into account self-duality * the root configuration contains two singular roots i.gamma on the first level and a singular 3-string (-2i.gamma,0,2i.gamma) on the second * corrections to scaling are power laws * the effective conformal weight is (-1/6) + 5.gamma/(2.pi) + 1 (descendent of class C state #1 in this sector)".
<http://localhost:5002/f03631a7-89f1-4116-9674-9bbb10f1ea92> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize> "120759"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>.
