<http://localhost:5002/e533de9a-c067-4d7d-8ae6-4021a8d2c7ec> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-bethe-ansatz-data-for-the-open-d_3-2-spin-chain>.
