<http://localhost:5002/e533de9a-c067-4d7d-8ae6-4021a8d2c7ec> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Bethe roots for a state of the even length D^{(2)}_3 spin chain with boundary conditions (epsilon=1,p=1) in the sector (h^l,h^r)=(1,1).  * degeneracy of this state is g=18, twice what one expects for this sector * the root configuration contains two singular roots i.gamma on the first level * corrections to scaling are power laws * the effective conformal weight is (-1/6) + 9.gamma/(2.pi)".
