<http://localhost:5002/6ce3e7e9-06b7-4dc1-89fc-2129e574be50> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T10:25:21.104201"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/b70bf820-5539-43b1-b4db-798f2cc9e835> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Distribution>.
