<http://localhost:5002/c6de9705-5b40-4914-8456-a190634377d3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T10:25:21.105856"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/76251b9e-d94c-4484-9a8b-adf793e3bd22> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Distribution>.
