<http://localhost:5002/327f133d-b813-4fe6-abd5-4b55b8c3a0ed> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This documentation contains relevant information about the measurement environment and setup. In addition, the data management, such as data naming and format, as well as the procedure for data anonymization, is briefly addressed.".
