<http://localhost:5002/32df4f01-0175-4f5d-874c-7f9c698c2417> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-su3k-non-abelian-anyons-thermodynamics>.
<http://localhost:5002/32df4f01-0175-4f5d-874c-7f9c698c2417> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-su3k-non-abelian-anyons-thermodynamics>.
<http://localhost:5002/32df4f01-0175-4f5d-874c-7f9c698c2417> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Same as Figure 1 but for magnetic fields $H_1\\equiv H_2$. In this case the elementary excitations for $m=1$ and $2$ are degenerate.".
