<http://localhost:5002/71cd2a2f-594c-4077-8e92-b16860518931> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T10:22:38.067206"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/14115f00-bf83-4c54-a142-0f332b92106b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Distribution>.
<http://localhost:5002/14115f00-bf83-4c54-a142-0f332b92106b> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Data for Fig. 4 of J. Phys. A 51 (2018) 495002".
<http://localhost:5002/14115f00-bf83-4c54-a142-0f332b92106b> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-su3k-non-abelian-anyons-thermodynamics>.
<http://localhost:5002/14115f00-bf83-4c54-a142-0f332b92106b> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-su3k-non-abelian-anyons-thermodynamics>.
<http://localhost:5002/14115f00-bf83-4c54-a142-0f332b92106b> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Entropy obtained from numerical solution of the TBA equations (3.2) for $p_0=2+1/3$ and $H_2\\equiv 0$ as a function of the field $(Z_1H_1/M_0$ for $T=0.01M_0$. For fields large compared to the soliton mass, $Z_1H_1\\gg M_0$, the entropy approaches the expected analytical value (3.18) for a field theory with a free bosonic sector and a $Z_{SU(3)_{N_f=2}}/Z_{SU(2)_{N_f=2}}$ parafermion sector propagating with velocities $v^{(1)}_{\\text{quark}}$ and $v^{(1)}_{pf}$, respectively (full red line). For magnetic fields $Z_1H_1<M_0$ and temperature $T\\ll M_0$ the entropy is that of a dilute gas of non-interacting quasi-particles with degenerate internal degree of freedom due to the anyons.".
<http://localhost:5002/14115f00-bf83-4c54-a142-0f332b92106b> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize> "10552"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>.
<http://localhost:5002/14115f00-bf83-4c54-a142-0f332b92106b> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/format> "ZIP".
<http://localhost:5002/14115f00-bf83-4c54-a142-0f332b92106b> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-03-18T13:57:03.839649"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/14115f00-bf83-4c54-a142-0f332b92106b> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T10:22:38.067316"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
