<http://localhost:5002/159a607a-3e4e-440e-910e-446015b745eb> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T10:22:38.067425"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/8ab605be-06a3-404a-bfd3-136209063805> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Distribution>.
