<http://localhost:5002/0544fb7e-2b60-4a63-9f2f-f52bb1b3a37a> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-reference-vibration-measurements-of-mensa-bridge-hannover>.
<http://localhost:5002/0544fb7e-2b60-4a63-9f2f-f52bb1b3a37a> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-reference-vibration-measurements-of-mensa-bridge-hannover>.
<http://localhost:5002/0544fb7e-2b60-4a63-9f2f-f52bb1b3a37a> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This is the measurement data of a vibration measurement. The CSV file contains the time series measurements of piezoelectric accelerometers placed at different positions at the bridge deck in horizontal directions (DSH1, DSH2 and DSH3) and vertical direction (DSV1 - DSV7). The first column in the file represents the time in seconds. The sampling rate is 2000 Hz. The accelerations are measured in meter per square second. The measurement directions are for accelerometer DSV1 to DSV5 in Z direction vertical to the ground, DSV6 and DSV6 are in -Z direction vertical to the top. For sensors DSH1 to DSH3 the measurement direction is in Y direction horizontal and orthogonal to the bridge\\' longitudinal axis. The vibration was excited by wind and pedestrians that walked on the bridge during the measurement (ambiant).".
<http://localhost:5002/0544fb7e-2b60-4a63-9f2f-f52bb1b3a37a> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize> "87515823"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>.
<http://localhost:5002/0544fb7e-2b60-4a63-9f2f-f52bb1b3a37a> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/format> "CSV".
