<http://localhost:5002/9ce7d729-acb6-47e6-b034-f4ee7e94985a> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset provides first experimental GPS/Galileo receiver antenna calibrations based on the robot calibration method. Please note, that the data is in experimental status and no (!) official calibration product. Thus, it is free for scientific research/use only.  Two sets of receiver antennas have been calibrated and are provided in this zip-package. The authors are interested on any use of the data set and any reply to improve the phase centre correction (PCC) estimation process.  Details on the content of the package can be found in the readme.txt file.".
