<http://localhost:5002/0cb2d55e-ca6b-49a7-b29e-807106006515> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "In preparation of the NFDI4Chem proposal for the National Research Data Infrastructure 2019 the NFDI4Chem team conducted a online survey with the aim to evaluate the current status of research data management in chemistry with a special focus on Germany. The dataset contains the raw data exported from SoSci Survey with all questions and answers.".
