<http://localhost:5002/36496d43-da3d-4863-8c97-1548ab4a61e5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Zip-file contains GeoTIFF raster data from the referenced Project on recreational ecosystem services (RES):  - RES demand-supply-match and missmatch (25 classes) - RES demand-supply-match and missmatch (9 classes) - Landscape AestheticQuality index (LAQ) - Landscape Diversity - Landscape Naturalness - Landscape Uniqueness - RES Demand at potential destinations - Recreational Landscape Quality (RLQ) - RLQ classes - RES Flow (180 minute travel time tolerance) - RES Flow (70 minute travel time tolerance)".
