<http://localhost:5002/eed33459-3790-494d-98d7-492efc1aa5db> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T10:05:48.222222"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/8f50bae6-1544-4589-bbdc-5044d7a02dfc> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Distribution>.
