<http://localhost:5002/09fdb4d9-485c-4aea-be9f-b15302a95790> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "# PALM input files  The input files for the precursor and main simulations can be found in the directory *SteeringFiles*. They include:  - a steering file for the initial run (p3d) and the restart run (p3dr) - a file  that describes the aerodynamic blade properties of the IEA 15 MW wind turbine (_wtm) - a static driver (NetCDF file) that describes the wind turbine coordinates and other turbine parameters (_wtmpar) - In case SBL-300-7D a large scale forcing file that describes the temperature advection tendencies (_lsf)  # Used PALM revisions  | Case        | Revision | | ----------- | -------- | | NBL-700-7D  | 4550     | | NBL-700-5D  | 4550     | | CBL-700-7D  | 4573     | | CBL-1400-7D | 4573     | | SBL-300-7D  | 4625     |  The PALM code is available at https://palm.muk.uni-hannover.de".
<http://localhost:5002/09fdb4d9-485c-4aea-be9f-b15302a95790> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize> "84829"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>.
