<http://localhost:5002/b67df8f5-0995-42e4-b90b-7750b5954afa> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This repository contains the replication package for our CCS\\'23 paper \\'“We’ve Disabled MFA for You”: An Evaluation of the Security and Usability of Multi-Factor Authentication Recovery Deployments\\', including:  - a list of all websites in our final sample  - tables with more detailed information regarding our analyzed websites  - codebooks used by the authors to categorize findings  - additional text templates, such as the initial help request and the debriefing email  - additional graphics with more information".
