<http://localhost:5002/428ea26a-57e8-45e5-9cc8-786795b67dc9> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-shape-error-prediction-in-5-axis-machining-using-graph-neural-networks>.
<http://localhost:5002/428ea26a-57e8-45e5-9cc8-786795b67dc9> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Data used as Input for GNN and SVM predictions. This includes multiple types of datafiles:  - Export_Dexeldata Contains all timesteps from the simulation (rows) and for each time step the name of the active tool and a list of the follwoging data for each cut dexel serparted by semicolon: 1. direction (0 = x-direction, 1 = y-direction, 2 = z-direction) 2. Index 3. ExtenderIndex 4. True/False if the dexel was created in this timestep 5. dexel Startpoint X-Coordinate 6. dexel Startpoint Y-Coordinate 7. dexel Startpoint Z-Coordinate 8. dexel Endpoint X-Coordinate 9. dexel Endpoint Y-Coordinate 10. dexel Endpoint Z-Coordinate 11. Tool engagement depth (startpoint) 11. Tool engagement depth (endpoint)  - TimeIndexExport List of timeindices from the simulation and the corresponding Extenderindices which were modified in this timestep.  - TimeSeries List of timeindices from the simulation and the corresponding simulation or process data  - Dexelcore Export of all dexel in the workpiece model at a given time and their associated data Direction; Index; ExtenderID; DexelNewlyCreated; Start-Point_X; Start-Point_Y; Start-Point_Z; End-Point_X; End-Point_Y; End-Point_Z;  TimeStepCut_StartPoint;  TimeStepCut_EndPoint;  HeightAtTool_StartPoint;  HeightAtTool_EndPoint;  Shape_Error_StartPoint;  Shape_Error_EndPoint; Shape_Error_Prediction_StartPoint;  Shape_Error_Prediction_EndPoint;  Shape_Error_Relevance_Flag_StartPoint; Shape_Error_Relevance_Flag_EndPoint;".
