<http://localhost:5002/9ab6de4f-1aca-4e5d-9902-f375278e1696> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This ressource contains the .m file necessary to generate the hydrognss dataset INPUT: daily GNSS vertical displacements (.mom file) to which NTAL, NTOL, SLEL, GIA and TB have been substracted in advance,         daily HYDL time series, and        monthly GRACE-derived displacements OUTPUT: hydrognss time series monthly  IMPORTANT NOTE: we consider that, in a preprocessing step, all data-sets have been equalized in time (same number of epochs for HYDL and GPS) For the comparison with GRACE: we consider that epochs corresponding to GRACE follow on have been eliminated in a preprocessing step from all data-set".
