<http://localhost:5002/0b87b349-742f-41ef-8949-85a23ebc5ba8> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This file provides the positions and sampling frequencies of the instrumentation used in the experiment. The data structure can be found in the readme. Further information on the experimental setup can be found in Fig. 1 in Herbst et al. (2025). Further information about the Large Wave Flume (GWK) can be found here: https://www.fzk.uni-hannover.de/en/the-fzk/equipment/gwk".
<http://localhost:5002/0b87b349-742f-41ef-8949-85a23ebc5ba8> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize> "1106"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>.
<http://localhost:5002/0b87b349-742f-41ef-8949-85a23ebc5ba8> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/format> "CSV".
<http://localhost:5002/0b87b349-742f-41ef-8949-85a23ebc5ba8> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2025-02-19T10:16:25.967331"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/0b87b349-742f-41ef-8949-85a23ebc5ba8> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T09:57:16.976612"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/02134c59-57dd-46ee-b692-95ab0aba5861> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Distribution>.
<http://localhost:5002/02134c59-57dd-46ee-b692-95ab0aba5861> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "02_test_conditions.csv".
<http://localhost:5002/02134c59-57dd-46ee-b692-95ab0aba5861> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-dataset-for-full-scale-experimental-study-on-wave-impacts-at-stepped-revetments>.
<http://localhost:5002/02134c59-57dd-46ee-b692-95ab0aba5861> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-dataset-for-full-scale-experimental-study-on-wave-impacts-at-stepped-revetments>.
<http://localhost:5002/02134c59-57dd-46ee-b692-95ab0aba5861> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This file contains the wave conditions at the toe of the structure for each test. The data structure can be found in the readme. Further information on the experimental setup can be found in Fig. 1 in Herbst et al. (2025) (https://doi.org/10.1016/j.coastaleng.2025.104705).".
<http://localhost:5002/02134c59-57dd-46ee-b692-95ab0aba5861> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize> "3243"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>.
<http://localhost:5002/02134c59-57dd-46ee-b692-95ab0aba5861> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/format> "CSV".
<http://localhost:5002/02134c59-57dd-46ee-b692-95ab0aba5861> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2025-02-19T10:17:49.224182"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/02134c59-57dd-46ee-b692-95ab0aba5861> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T09:57:16.976749"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/46878516-6db4-4508-8b92-feb6af4ff2fc> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Distribution>.
<http://localhost:5002/46878516-6db4-4508-8b92-feb6af4ff2fc> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "03_impact_data.csv".
<http://localhost:5002/46878516-6db4-4508-8b92-feb6af4ff2fc> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-dataset-for-full-scale-experimental-study-on-wave-impacts-at-stepped-revetments>.
<http://localhost:5002/46878516-6db4-4508-8b92-feb6af4ff2fc> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-dataset-for-full-scale-experimental-study-on-wave-impacts-at-stepped-revetments>.
<http://localhost:5002/46878516-6db4-4508-8b92-feb6af4ff2fc> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This file contains measured impact pressures and rise times of different probabilities of non-exceedance, as well as impact counts for each pressure transducer of each test. The data structure can be found in the readme. All pressure values are given dimensionally in kilopascal [kPa]. Values in Herbst et al. (2025) are dimensionless, normalized by ρgHm0 (density, gravitational acceleration, and spectral wave height of the respective test).".
