<http://localhost:5002/e62648d8-4a6e-40c4-a482-628791856ef8> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Data of velocity values integrated to the canopy height and used for further calculations using u_c and u_wrms.  M0,M1 and M2 tables correspond to the same as in DATA separated by mat configuration  Variables in DATA correspond to velocity data, same nomenclature as described for Param_Table.mat".
