<http://localhost:5002/12ad9e32-47fe-4e62-b96b-4767e19a2161> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Velocities at each height and averaged values".
<http://localhost:5002/12ad9e32-47fe-4e62-b96b-4767e19a2161> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-seagrasswavedynamics_rv>.
<http://localhost:5002/12ad9e32-47fe-4e62-b96b-4767e19a2161> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-seagrasswavedynamics_rv>.
<http://localhost:5002/12ad9e32-47fe-4e62-b96b-4767e19a2161> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Data for Figure 8 in Villanueva et al. 2023  Full_Table (168 runs) Data for the velocities (see variable names of Param_Table.mat)  Data is also separated and averaged for all runs, disambiguated by the ADV position (i.e. z-coordinate). Mean values for all measurements shown in D_zAVG_all and the error in D_zAVG_e_all. The Structures with no \\'_all\\' correspond to the values for each mat configuration.".
<http://localhost:5002/12ad9e32-47fe-4e62-b96b-4767e19a2161> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize> "96296"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>.
<http://localhost:5002/12ad9e32-47fe-4e62-b96b-4767e19a2161> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-06-27T14:39:04.740378"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/12ad9e32-47fe-4e62-b96b-4767e19a2161> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-08-12T10:18:45.257268"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/7c3598b2-8dbe-4aec-984c-bde4bb46d298> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Distribution>.
<http://localhost:5002/7c3598b2-8dbe-4aec-984c-bde4bb46d298> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Bottom Average Data (Near Bead)".
<http://localhost:5002/7c3598b2-8dbe-4aec-984c-bde4bb46d298> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-seagrasswavedynamics_rv>.
<http://localhost:5002/7c3598b2-8dbe-4aec-984c-bde4bb46d298> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL> <http://localhost:5002/luh-seagrasswavedynamics_rv>.
<http://localhost:5002/7c3598b2-8dbe-4aec-984c-bde4bb46d298> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "These tables contain the processed averaged data for the trials with ASG (X1) used for Villanueva et al. 2022 and to initiate calculations of Villanueva et al. 2023  I post-processed the data and calculated the average values of all repetitions belonging to one T-H combination (run). The velocities (u and w) correspond to the reading of the ADVs at the bottom (i.e. 3.3 cm from the bed, code: A1). For the rest of the devices, the values at all heights (A1-A5) were averaged and the error calculated. NOTE: For the plots, it is necessary to substract the control values in order to identify the real forces caused by the mats with ASG.".
